(2000668, 276209, 41521, '<td valign="top">Double border is unattractive.  The uneven color of the red/orange background, along with the fuzziness of the midpoint is distracting.  The use of color is very nice, tho having the balls match the backgrounds a bit more would boost the impact.  I really like the texture on the balls.</td>', 'Double border is unattractive.  The uneven color of the red/orange background, along with the fuzziness of the midpoint is distracting.  The use of color is very nice, tho having the balls match the backgrounds a bit more would boost the impact.  I really like the texture on the balls.', '2006-01-04 00:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000670, 274079, 41521, '<td valign="top">Leaves are a bit blown out on the right.  I like the use of b/w.</td>', 'Leaves are a bit blown out on the right.  I like the use of b/w.', '2006-01-04 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000671, 274841, 5885, '<td valign="top">I''ve got to find this chicks web site ;-)</td>', 'I''ve got to find this chicks web site ;-)', '2006-01-04 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000683, 275929, 41521, '<td valign="top">Lots of shapes make this a very busy photo.  I don''t like the way the squares fade from top to bottom.  Keeping them vivid black would add more impact.  It looks like you used 3 different color liquids in the middle, but they appear very similar - a bright green or yellow would have really stood out.  The dark green at the top seems an afterthought, as it blends into the dark squares.  Overall, i like this quite a bit.</td>', 'Lots of shapes make this a very busy photo.  I don''t like the way the squares fade from top to bottom.  Keeping them vivid black would add more impact.  It looks like you used 3 different color liquids in the middle, but they appear very similar - a bright green or yellow would have really stood out.  The dark green at the top seems an afterthought, as it blends into the dark squares.  Overall, i like this quite a bit.', '2006-01-04 00:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000686, 276203, 48928, '<td valign="top">i like the photo, but for the title the subject is very little part of the photo, 6</td>', 'i like the photo, but for the title the subject is very little part of the photo, 6', '2006-01-04 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
