(2002502, 276445, 44304, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning... the composition of this photograph blows away similiar firework displays in that it concentrates on the beauty of the individual birth of a beautiful shape.  It takes me back to a time when things more simple and reminds me of a work by Ansel Adams.  Each small flare reaches out and speaks to me as if to say "I''m free!  I''m free!" and at the same time blossoms with independence.  You have shown the symbolism of the new year and also that of the fourth of july.  The birth of this sphere could represent the birth of a new year or new beginning, while the flares screams of freedom could represent our country and the celebration of the 4th of july.  This is a timeless photograph that will be spoken of for generations to come.  I only pity the other images that have been shadowed by this work of art.</td>', 'Simply stunning... the composition of this photograph blows away similiar firework displays in that it concentrates on the beauty of the individual birth of a beautiful shape.  It takes me back to a time when things more simple and reminds me of a work by Ansel Adams.  Each small flare reaches out and speaks to me as if to say "I''m free!  I''m free!" and at the same time blossoms with independence.  You have shown the symbolism of the new year and also that of the fourth of july.  The birth of this sphere could represent the birth of a new year or new beginning, while the flares screams of freedom could represent our country and the celebration of the 4th of july.  This is a timeless photograph that will be spoken of for generations to come.  I only pity the other images that have been shadowed by this work of art.', '2006-01-04 10:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002503, 276170, 43869, '<td valign="top">beautiful!  I give this a 10.</td>', 'beautiful!  I give this a 10.', '2006-01-04 10:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
