(2002550, 276089, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured this "heart-shape" made from a person waving a sparkler. It is a good action capture, but it suffers from too much being in the scene - the scene is too cluttered with other things that distracts attention from the main subject. The eye tends to wander the room as the main subject is swallowed up by so many things surrounding her. A tighter crop to speciffically center on the main action would have been better....Or if during the shot you had another person facing the woman making the heart (a mother or a sinificant other) such that the visual idea would be that she is making this heart for them. This shot would also have to be tightly cropped so that focus remains on the main elements of the shot.</td>', 'I like how you captured this "heart-shape" made from a person waving a sparkler. It is a good action capture, but it suffers from too much being in the scene - the scene is too cluttered with other things that distracts attention from the main subject. The eye tends to wander the room as the main subject is swallowed up by so many things surrounding her. A tighter crop to speciffically center on the main action would have been better....Or if during the shot you had another person facing the woman making the heart (a mother or a sinificant other) such that the visual idea would be that she is making this heart for them. This shot would also have to be tightly cropped so that focus remains on the main elements of the shot.', '2006-01-04 11:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002551, 276209, 32338, '<td valign="top">Stunning use of contrast and DOF.</td>', 'Stunning use of contrast and DOF.', '2006-01-04 11:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002554, 276426, 46094, '<td valign="top">Good Shot!  Watch the lens flare in the future, but excellent clarity and leveling.  This is a great pic.  Maybe just a tad more touchup with contrast/brightness.  GOOD FOCUS.</td>', 'Good Shot!  Watch the lens flare in the future, but excellent clarity and leveling.  This is a great pic.  Maybe just a tad more touchup with contrast/brightness.  GOOD FOCUS.', '2006-01-04 11:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
