(2002685, 273576, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the curves in the bent swirls that radiate out to the lighted circles. It almost gives the scene a sense of motion. Color hues of this composition are nice warm ones. Love how the rich brown of the ceiling complements the warm amber/cream of the circular portions of this lighted fixture. My critique is that I think the image would be strengthened if you did a tighter crop so the eye''s focus stays on the main subject - there is too much empty space on the right and left.</td>', 'I like the curves in the bent swirls that radiate out to the lighted circles. It almost gives the scene a sense of motion. Color hues of this composition are nice warm ones. Love how the rich brown of the ceiling complements the warm amber/cream of the circular portions of this lighted fixture. My critique is that I think the image would be strengthened if you did a tighter crop so the eye''s focus stays on the main subject - there is too much empty space on the right and left.', '2006-01-04 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
