(2002785, 273744, 1066, '<td valign="top">A simple idea well executed.  Even though this concept has been around since Ansel Adams..its alway a pleasure to see someone work with the idea and do it well :-D</td>', 'A simple idea well executed.  Even though this concept has been around since Ansel Adams..its alway a pleasure to see someone work with the idea and do it well :-D', '2006-01-04 12:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
