(2002803, 274672, 1066, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast.   It feels a little too blown or contrasty at times but it is well balanced and nicely composed so still one of my favorites :-D</td>', 'Love the contrast.   It feels a little too blown or contrasty at times but it is well balanced and nicely composed so still one of my favorites :-D', '2006-01-04 12:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002808, 276454, 46468, '<td valign="top">Really like how you have used the shape of the person to divide the light and dark. Well done, only thing I "might" have tried was to make the division on the thirds more. Would have to see it to really know if it would have worked better or not though. And you may have already tried it and not like it as well. Oh well, really do like it and hope you do well</td>', 'Really like how you have used the shape of the person to divide the light and dark. Well done, only thing I "might" have tried was to make the division on the thirds more. Would have to see it to really know if it would have worked better or not though. And you may have already tried it and not like it as well. Oh well, really do like it and hope you do well', '2006-01-04 12:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002809, 276456, 1066, '<td valign="top">Simply Wonderful.  Caught my eye right away.  You people that live near dramatic coastlines are very lucky.  Nice touch to have the people in the photo to add some scale.  One of my favorites!</td>', 'Simply Wonderful.  Caught my eye right away.  You people that live near dramatic coastlines are very lucky.  Nice touch to have the people in the photo to add some scale.  One of my favorites!', '2006-01-04 12:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002811, 276470, 1066, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s me but I am impressed with the shear fact you could even get this photo!  Unless I am completely mistaken and this is a spot off a very cool parkway drive.  One of my best.</td>', 'Maybe it''s me but I am impressed with the shear fact you could even get this photo!  Unless I am completely mistaken and this is a spot off a very cool parkway drive.  One of my best.', '2006-01-04 12:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
