(2002817, 276180, 46468, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, and definately meets the challange. However, IMO, the white by the reds is a little overexposed and the lights around it are a wee bit harsh. Maybe just a slightly faster shutter speed would have corrected this. Just my opinion. Good luck - 5</td>', 'Like the idea, and definately meets the challange. However, IMO, the white by the reds is a little overexposed and the lights around it are a wee bit harsh. Maybe just a slightly faster shutter speed would have corrected this. Just my opinion. Good luck - 5', '2006-01-04 12:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002822, 276454, 1066, '<td valign="top">Several silouhettes in this challenge and yours imediately caught my eye.  This is a good example of taking a simple idea that is pretty common and adding that little twist that just makes it pop out and special.  One of my best.</td>', 'Several silouhettes in this challenge and yours imediately caught my eye.  This is a good example of taking a simple idea that is pretty common and adding that little twist that just makes it pop out and special.  One of my best.', '2006-01-04 12:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
