(2003879, 274356, 22379, '<td valign="top">If you got this camera for christmas, i would consider getting your money back and investing in something a bit better. The pixaltion in this image hurts this photo drastically. This is a hardware or software problem, and not represntation of you as a photographer.</td>', 'If you got this camera for christmas, i would consider getting your money back and investing in something a bit better. The pixaltion in this image hurts this photo drastically. This is a hardware or software problem, and not represntation of you as a photographer.', '2006-01-04 16:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
