(2003892, 276477, 39410, '<td valign="top">I really like the toning and perspective of this one. I think it is a very strong shot. I do find the light area in the lower left and the small lens flare a little distracting, but overall, it is a good shot.</td>', 'I really like the toning and perspective of this one. I think it is a very strong shot. I do find the light area in the lower left and the small lens flare a little distracting, but overall, it is a good shot.', '2006-01-04 16:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
