(2003913, 273733, 25553, '<td valign="top">the picture in the back is what truly makes this picture and unfotunately it doesnt seem that you have taken this picture. but since im not here to decide if you took it or not but only to evaluate the end result and application to the challenge topic as i see fit, my final veredict is in favor of the end image. it looks good and the oranges almost match the feel of the BG picture. my apologies if i have wrongly accused you..</td>', 'the picture in the back is what truly makes this picture and unfotunately it doesnt seem that you have taken this picture. but since im not here to decide if you took it or not but only to evaluate the end result and application to the challenge topic as i see fit, my final veredict is in favor of the end image. it looks good and the oranges almost match the feel of the BG picture. my apologies if i have wrongly accused you..', '2006-01-04 16:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2003914, 276428, 39410, '<td valign="top">I am not sure about the lime green background on this one. It is a nice contrast to the black, but gives an odd cast to the yellow/green design that is close but not the same color. It is however a very strong image.</td>', 'I am not sure about the lime green background on this one. It is a nice contrast to the black, but gives an odd cast to the yellow/green design that is close but not the same color. It is however a very strong image.', '2006-01-04 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
