(2005323, 273921, 31403, '<td valign="top">the subtle gradations reached out and grabbed me, I hope others stop to appreciate the lighting - 7</td>', 'the subtle gradations reached out and grabbed me, I hope others stop to appreciate the lighting - 7', '2006-01-04 23:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005324, 275901, 45857, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Interesting abstract shape.<br/>Excellent job of keeping the shape the major element, yet displaying the texture of your subject.</td>', 'Great lighting. Interesting abstract shape.Excellent job of keeping the shape the major element, yet displaying the texture of your subject.', '2006-01-04 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005325, 273438, 10402, '<td valign="top">The colors and contrasts really hold my attention. Very nicely done.</td>', 'The colors and contrasts really hold my attention. Very nicely done.', '2006-01-04 23:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005331, 275756, 49818, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and lighting</td>', 'Nice idea and lighting', '2006-01-04 23:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005340, 276475, 39184, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus.</td>', 'A little out of focus.', '2006-01-04 23:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005341, 276022, 10402, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t need a title; let the viewer choose! Great technique on a technically difficult capture. I really like this one.</td>', 'It doesn''t need a title; let the viewer choose! Great technique on a technically difficult capture. I really like this one.', '2006-01-04 23:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005344, 275310, 6519, '<td valign="top">Why? What did I do to you?  :-(</td>', 'Why? What did I do to you?  :-(', '2006-01-04 23:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005350, 275944, 39184, '<td valign="top">Maybe it was intentional, but I would like to have seen the yellow star the same "shape" as the other two.  I felt let down when I scrolled down and saw the yellow one.  The upper left arm is shadowed by the height of the star whereas the others are nicely shown.</td>', 'Maybe it was intentional, but I would like to have seen the yellow star the same "shape" as the other two.  I felt let down when I scrolled down and saw the yellow one.  The upper left arm is shadowed by the height of the star whereas the others are nicely shown.', '2006-01-04 23:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005357, 275919, 45857, '<td valign="top">Very good image of textures and colors, which both obfuscates the shape.</td>', 'Very good image of textures and colors, which both obfuscates the shape.', '2006-01-04 23:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005366, 273446, 49818, '<td valign="top">Lightly seasoned??!</td>', 'Lightly seasoned??!', '2006-01-04 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005368, 276470, 6519, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness...... wow.... woah</td>', 'Oh my goodness...... wow.... woah', '2006-01-04 23:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005371, 276273, 39184, '<td valign="top">Something doesn''t seem quite right with the pepperoni.  Also, I don''t know if it would be possible to avoid, but three of the reflections of light are very white and distracting.  Very dramatic choice of colors though.</td>', 'Something doesn''t seem quite right with the pepperoni.  Also, I don''t know if it would be possible to avoid, but three of the reflections of light are very white and distracting.  Very dramatic choice of colors though.', '2006-01-04 23:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005373, 275088, 45857, '<td valign="top">Great image, love the lighting effect, but think the repetition transends the concept of shape, making it a pattern.</td>', 'Great image, love the lighting effect, but think the repetition transends the concept of shape, making it a pattern.', '2006-01-04 23:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005376, 276003, 48560, '<td valign="top">this one needs a tighter crop around the face.</td>', 'this one needs a tighter crop around the face.', '2006-01-04 23:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005393, 275182, 39184, '<td valign="top">This picture had me twisting my head like a confused dog, then suddenly I said "Ohhh, I''ve got it!"</td>', 'This picture had me twisting my head like a confused dog, then suddenly I said "Ohhh, I''ve got it!"', '2006-01-04 23:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005397, 276392, 39184, '<td valign="top">Then reflection in the sphere looks like a horizon with a tree or two on it.  If that is the case and the image had been cropped to clearly show that scene, this image would been a lot more powerful.</td>', 'Then reflection in the sphere looks like a horizon with a tree or two on it.  If that is the case and the image had been cropped to clearly show that scene, this image would been a lot more powerful.', '2006-01-04 23:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005400, 275947, 39184, '<td valign="top">This shows shapes well, must have been a lot of work.</td>', 'This shows shapes well, must have been a lot of work.', '2006-01-04 23:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005401, 275804, 39184, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better if teh DOF had been increased to bring more shells into focus.</td>', 'I would have liked this better if teh DOF had been increased to bring more shells into focus.', '2006-01-04 23:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005409, 274322, 39184, '<td valign="top">I TOOK THE SAME SHOT!!!  AAAARGHHH!  I wish that I had used it, but then again, it would be like showing up at the party with the same dress on.  Nice job...my highest score so far.  By the way, were you visiting or do you live here?</td>', 'I TOOK THE SAME SHOT!!!  AAAARGHHH!  I wish that I had used it, but then again, it would be like showing up at the party with the same dress on.  Nice job...my highest score so far.  By the way, were you visiting or do you live here?', '2006-01-04 23:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005419, 273738, 48298, '<td valign="top">Cool...a friend of ours has an eagle''s nest on her property, too!  Good eye!</td>', 'Cool...a friend of ours has an eagle''s nest on her property, too!  Good eye!', '2006-01-05 00:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005428, 274099, 49818, '<td valign="top">My favorite choc</td>', 'My favorite choc', '2006-01-05 00:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005446, 275622, 42256, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and colors, good composition!</td>', 'Nice DOF and colors, good composition!', '2006-01-05 00:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005451, 276223, 48298, '<td valign="top">Different...I like it!</td>', 'Different...I like it!', '2006-01-05 00:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005452, 275152, 42256, '<td valign="top">great capture ! Most unique shape in the challenge so far</td>', 'great capture ! Most unique shape in the challenge so far', '2006-01-05 00:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005456, 276278, 48876, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of this shot!</td>', 'I like the texture of this shot!', '2006-01-05 00:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005457, 276264, 42256, '<td valign="top">I like what you tried capturing, but the picture looks crowded, I don''t know what you could have done to avoid that but this is just what I thought.</td>', 'I like what you tried capturing, but the picture looks crowded, I don''t know what you could have done to avoid that but this is just what I thought.', '2006-01-05 00:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005461, 276470, 42256, '<td valign="top">Locations, locations, locations. I don''t know if you follow the forum threads, but I see what they were talking about in that thread now.<br/> <br/>Amazing shot!!</td>', 'Locations, locations, locations. I don''t know if you follow the forum threads, but I see what they were talking about in that thread now. Amazing shot!!', '2006-01-05 00:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005468, 274900, 48298, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Fabulous perspective and original concept.  10.</td>', 'Nice!  Fabulous perspective and original concept.  10.', '2006-01-05 00:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005477, 274356, 48876, '<td valign="top">Wish it was sharper.</td>', 'Wish it was sharper.', '2006-01-05 00:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005479, 275291, 48876, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!</td>', 'Neat shot!', '2006-01-05 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005492, 274398, 48876, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-01-05 00:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005498, 276038, 48876, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!The color of the sky with the green is Lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful!The color of the sky with the green is Lovely.', '2006-01-05 00:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005507, 273757, 6519, '<td valign="top">Frozen fauna? That is so sad...... where is the poor creature?<br/> <br/>I like the lighting on the trees... beautiful mood in this photo, but not the best example for this challenge.</td>', 'Frozen fauna? That is so sad...... where is the poor creature? I like the lighting on the trees... beautiful mood in this photo, but not the best example for this challenge.', '2006-01-05 00:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005512, 276284, 49818, '<td valign="top">Maybe a brown egg on a white background</td>', 'Maybe a brown egg on a white background', '2006-01-05 00:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005528, 274118, 48876, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!My Guess is you will be one of the top 5!</td>', 'Beautiful!My Guess is you will be one of the top 5!', '2006-01-05 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005544, 275206, 42826, '<td valign="top">nice lighting with this...4:20 huh....very nice!!!</td>', 'nice lighting with this...4:20 huh....very nice!!!', '2006-01-05 00:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005557, 276447, 48876, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-01-05 00:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005562, 273902, 48876, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2006-01-05 00:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005564, 275649, 48876, '<td valign="top">Looks beautiful,wish it was larger.</td>', 'Looks beautiful,wish it was larger.', '2006-01-05 00:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005571, 276089, 48876, '<td valign="top">Very unique!Great shot!</td>', 'Very unique!Great shot!', '2006-01-05 00:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005577, 275296, 48876, '<td valign="top">I love it!Great Texture and color!</td>', 'I love it!Great Texture and color!', '2006-01-05 00:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005598, 275622, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs to be in focus.</td>', 'Needs to be in focus.', '2006-01-05 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005630, 275312, 15643, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but i have to say this. Water drops are OLD!</td>', 'I am sorry but i have to say this. Water drops are OLD!', '2006-01-05 01:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005632, 274631, 35545, '<td valign="top">You need to spell your title correctly.</td>', 'You need to spell your title correctly.', '2006-01-05 01:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005635, 275654, 45857, '<td valign="top">While your image is made of objects with shape, you have displayed them in such a confusion that the only Impression i get is texture.</td>', 'While your image is made of objects with shape, you have displayed them in such a confusion that the only Impression i get is texture.', '2006-01-05 01:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005657, 273795, 45857, '<td valign="top">I am unable to find the dominate shape in this image. The biological shapes are overwhelmed by the bubbles, but the perfusion of bubbles is more of a pattern or texture element.</td>', 'I am unable to find the dominate shape in this image. The biological shapes are overwhelmed by the bubbles, but the perfusion of bubbles is more of a pattern or texture element.', '2006-01-05 01:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005660, 273720, 45857, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of patterns, without the dominate shape</td>', 'This is a great example of patterns, without the dominate shape', '2006-01-05 01:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005674, 276022, 45857, '<td valign="top">Certainly a beautiful fixture, very well photographed. I love the diagonal which draws you back to the subject. The pattern of the lamp is a wonderful element here, without overhelming the basic sphere.</td>', 'Certainly a beautiful fixture, very well photographed. I love the diagonal which draws you back to the subject. The pattern of the lamp is a wonderful element here, without overhelming the basic sphere.', '2006-01-05 01:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005692, 275209, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia treatment, interesting subject</td>', 'Nice sepia treatment, interesting subject', '2006-01-05 02:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005695, 276089, 47487, '<td valign="top">Looks like it was fun to shoot. :) I think I might like a tighter crop -- maybe just the person with the heart and the Christmas tree? -- a bit better. There''s a lot of extraneous information in the shot that''s a bit distracting. A well-made, nicely lit photo though.</td>', 'Looks like it was fun to shoot. :) I think I might like a tighter crop -- maybe just the person with the heart and the Christmas tree? -- a bit better. There''s a lot of extraneous information in the shot that''s a bit distracting. A well-made, nicely lit photo though.', '2006-01-05 02:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005700, 275133, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is clever, not your run-of-the-mill circles shot. (Is there a time zone that''s fifteen minutes off from the rest? I know there are some on the half-hour...). Light and colors are good here -- I like the muted gray, black, and white with the metal watches.</td>', 'This is clever, not your run-of-the-mill circles shot. (Is there a time zone that''s fifteen minutes off from the rest? I know there are some on the half-hour...). Light and colors are good here -- I like the muted gray, black, and white with the metal watches.', '2006-01-05 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005706, 275089, 47487, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the droplets don''t really catch my eye, especially as regards their shape(s), which seem really random. Also, there are water spots on the glass that are distracting especially in the green areas. This is a good idea for a shot -- one that''s pretty popular but I don''t fault you for that. The colors are vivid and the patterns in the drops are quite visually interesting.</td>', 'Unfortunately the droplets don''t really catch my eye, especially as regards their shape(s), which seem really random. Also, there are water spots on the glass that are distracting especially in the green areas. This is a good idea for a shot -- one that''s pretty popular but I don''t fault you for that. The colors are vivid and the patterns in the drops are quite visually interesting.', '2006-01-05 02:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005707, 273659, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. I really like the way the fallen tree leads the eye into the shot.</td>', 'Lovely image. I really like the way the fallen tree leads the eye into the shot.', '2006-01-05 02:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005708, 276104, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, but it seems odd to cut off the reflection to me - particularly as you use the mirrored bit in your title.</td>', 'Great clarity, but it seems odd to cut off the reflection to me - particularly as you use the mirrored bit in your title.', '2006-01-05 02:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005709, 274162, 47487, '<td valign="top">The cross almost blends in to the background. Could you have used a narrower depth of field to set it off by itself a bit more? Or perhaps a different angle -- is that the edge of a circular dark area I see up in the left? The cross against something like that would have been truly striking.<br/> <br/> I like the idea and the tones here. The composition, other than the bit of circle on the left which couldn''t be helped at that angle, is pleasing.</td>', 'The cross almost blends in to the background. Could you have used a narrower depth of field to set it off by itself a bit more? Or perhaps a different angle -- is that the edge of a circular dark area I see up in the left? The cross against something like that would have been truly striking.  I like the idea and the tones here. The composition, other than the bit of circle on the left which couldn''t be helped at that angle, is pleasing.', '2006-01-05 02:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005713, 276172, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot; fabulous colour.</td>', 'Lovely shot; fabulous colour.', '2006-01-05 02:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005714, 275996, 45857, '<td valign="top">This is a good interpretation. The subdued tonal range of the framed ''picture'' contrasted with the highlights of the circular ''frame'' maintained the shape as a dominate aspect.</td>', 'This is a good interpretation. The subdued tonal range of the framed ''picture'' contrasted with the highlights of the circular ''frame'' maintained the shape as a dominate aspect.', '2006-01-05 02:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005715, 274720, 44611, '<td valign="top">Superb.  This is lovely - top marks and one of my favourites.</td>', 'Superb.  This is lovely - top marks and one of my favourites.', '2006-01-05 02:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005716, 274645, 44611, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh!  Great colours and composition.</td>', 'This made me laugh!  Great colours and composition.', '2006-01-05 02:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005719, 276020, 47487, '<td valign="top">Are those gilded or did this get very heavily color-edited?<br/> <br/>The dent at the top of the apple, right at the focal point (imo), is really distracting in this. I like the composition, though, and the narrow depth of field.</td>', 'Are those gilded or did this get very heavily color-edited? The dent at the top of the apple, right at the focal point (imo), is really distracting in this. I like the composition, though, and the narrow depth of field.', '2006-01-05 02:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005720, 276428, 44611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - love the green background it works perfectly.</td>', 'Beautiful - love the green background it works perfectly.', '2006-01-05 02:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005722, 273998, 47487, '<td valign="top">What stands out to me here is the sun and its reflective trail in the water; the dog is almost an afterthought to my eye, yet I assume that''s the shape you''re wanting me to notice. As an ordinary image I love this; the composition is great, the scene is pretty; the silhouette adds interest. As an image where the shape of the subject draws my attention, it lacks a little bit. 7.</td>', 'What stands out to me here is the sun and its reflective trail in the water; the dog is almost an afterthought to my eye, yet I assume that''s the shape you''re wanting me to notice. As an ordinary image I love this; the composition is great, the scene is pretty; the silhouette adds interest. As an image where the shape of the subject draws my attention, it lacks a little bit. 7.', '2006-01-05 02:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005723, 274702, 45857, '<td valign="top">Simple eloquent interpretation.</td>', 'Simple eloquent interpretation.', '2006-01-05 02:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005728, 275896, 47487, '<td valign="top">If I could see the whole shapes, they''d catch my eye better. :) Still, a lovely, lovely photo. The symmetry and color are very good -- although -- is the focus off a titch? Just as photo I think I''d give this an 8 -- considering that the shapes are incomplete I''ll rate it at 7. I may come back and change my mind later. :)</td>', 'If I could see the whole shapes, they''d catch my eye better. :) Still, a lovely, lovely photo. The symmetry and color are very good -- although -- is the focus off a titch? Just as photo I think I''d give this an 8 -- considering that the shapes are incomplete I''ll rate it at 7. I may come back and change my mind later. :)', '2006-01-05 02:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005729, 276035, 44611, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrasts here between the new yellow/brown brickwork and the old red and again with the flaking render and blue paint.  Very well seen combination of contrasts.</td>', 'I really like the contrasts here between the new yellow/brown brickwork and the old red and again with the flaking render and blue paint.  Very well seen combination of contrasts.', '2006-01-05 02:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005730, 273327, 47487, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame his lines are broken by the fence; this would be a great deal more striking as a full silhouette. The truck behind her is a wee bit distracting as well. Still, a nice image, and a good idea. 6.</td>', 'It''s a shame his lines are broken by the fence; this would be a great deal more striking as a full silhouette. The truck behind her is a wee bit distracting as well. Still, a nice image, and a good idea. 6.', '2006-01-05 02:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005731, 274198, 47487, '<td valign="top">Ooh yes. Very nice. Shame about the haze -- wouldn''t it be nice if we could get our days to order when we wanted to go out shooting? But you''ve composed this beautifully. 8.</td>', 'Ooh yes. Very nice. Shame about the haze -- wouldn''t it be nice if we could get our days to order when we wanted to go out shooting? But you''ve composed this beautifully. 8.', '2006-01-05 02:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005733, 273576, 47487, '<td valign="top">YES, beautiful. Perfectly composed, perfectly exposed, original and fun to look at. 10 from me; I can''t find a flaw. Isn''t it nice having things like this around to photograph? :)</td>', 'YES, beautiful. Perfectly composed, perfectly exposed, original and fun to look at. 10 from me; I can''t find a flaw. Isn''t it nice having things like this around to photograph? :)', '2006-01-05 02:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005737, 276346, 47487, '<td valign="top">Artistically, this is an excellent composition. I think for this specific challenge, though, if you''d found an equally compelling way to focus and compose it straight on, the shapes would have popped more. Nice work, though. I like the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Artistically, this is an excellent composition. I think for this specific challenge, though, if you''d found an equally compelling way to focus and compose it straight on, the shapes would have popped more. Nice work, though. I like the shallow DOF.', '2006-01-05 02:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005740, 273902, 47487, '<td valign="top">What a dilemma. Go more panoramic and you have to lose height to meet the size requirement; a centered composition of this would be boring; and yet the way you''ve cut off the side makes it less visually startling as a shape. Still a very good image, and I think you chose the least of the three evils. (wish you''d left the tippy top intact, though.)</td>', 'What a dilemma. Go more panoramic and you have to lose height to meet the size requirement; a centered composition of this would be boring; and yet the way you''ve cut off the side makes it less visually startling as a shape. Still a very good image, and I think you chose the least of the three evils. (wish you''d left the tippy top intact, though.)', '2006-01-05 02:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005742, 274333, 47487, '<td valign="top">Wow! This just pops. Your focus is fantastic.</td>', 'Wow! This just pops. Your focus is fantastic.', '2006-01-05 02:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005744, 274792, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject; makes me want to keep looking at it. :)</td>', 'Very interesting subject; makes me want to keep looking at it. :)', '2006-01-05 02:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005746, 275153, 47487, '<td valign="top">nice macro!</td>', 'nice macro!', '2006-01-05 02:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005749, 274979, 47487, '<td valign="top">I''m torn about the empty space here. Some suits this subject well, but I think there''s maybe a little more than I would like best. Maybe a vertical crop from the bottom of the slope on the left, and a corresponding amount on the right? I dunno. The colors are pretty and I like the subject very much. Even the trees in the background, which might have been distracting, just (to me) give a nice sense of context.</td>', 'I''m torn about the empty space here. Some suits this subject well, but I think there''s maybe a little more than I would like best. Maybe a vertical crop from the bottom of the slope on the left, and a corresponding amount on the right? I dunno. The colors are pretty and I like the subject very much. Even the trees in the background, which might have been distracting, just (to me) give a nice sense of context.', '2006-01-05 02:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005753, 275637, 47487, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going to have to come back to this one after the challenge and find out what it is. :) Really a very visually interesting subject, well-lit with nice focus. I think I personally might have liked it even better if you''d cropped it below the blue corners. 7</td>', 'OK, I''m going to have to come back to this one after the challenge and find out what it is. :) Really a very visually interesting subject, well-lit with nice focus. I think I personally might have liked it even better if you''d cropped it below the blue corners. 7', '2006-01-05 02:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005758, 275654, 47487, '<td valign="top">My eye doesn''t know where to rest here; there''s no focal point at all. Maybe one sequin of a different color (if you had one) somewhere, with the focus on that, would have helped? Clever idea. I like the red/pink.</td>', 'My eye doesn''t know where to rest here; there''s no focal point at all. Maybe one sequin of a different color (if you had one) somewhere, with the focus on that, would have helped? Clever idea. I like the red/pink.', '2006-01-05 02:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005760, 273446, 47487, '<td valign="top">Well, it certainly does stand out. :) Clever!</td>', 'Well, it certainly does stand out. :) Clever!', '2006-01-05 02:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005765, 274585, 45857, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of things going on.<br/>Its hard not to think that color is the major element, but the limited contrast between subject and background neutralizes the effect. there also is the pattern on the lure to consider, but the shape is still dominate.</td>', 'This image has a lot of things going on.Its hard not to think that color is the major element, but the limited contrast between subject and background neutralizes the effect. there also is the pattern on the lure to consider, but the shape is still dominate.', '2006-01-05 02:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005769, 276205, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is blurry, and while I respect your artistic right to interpret the challenge as you see fit, there''s no shape here that pops out at me. I do like the colors. Keep trying -- one of the best things about digital photography and this site in particular is how much we can learn in a really short time.</td>', 'This is blurry, and while I respect your artistic right to interpret the challenge as you see fit, there''s no shape here that pops out at me. I do like the colors. Keep trying -- one of the best things about digital photography and this site in particular is how much we can learn in a really short time.', '2006-01-05 02:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005771, 275393, 47487, '<td valign="top">Ooh wow. Very sharp, great colors. I really like this.</td>', 'Ooh wow. Very sharp, great colors. I really like this.', '2006-01-05 02:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005775, 276101, 45857, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of interesting patterns and textures here, but no strong element of shape.</td>', 'I see a lot of interesting patterns and textures here, but no strong element of shape.', '2006-01-05 02:39:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2005776, 276432, 47487, '<td valign="top">Actually at this angle they''re ellipses or ovals. ;) I like the repetition with the paint bottles, but the level of extraneous information in the shot, as well as the fact that the rims of the bowls are interrupted, makes it hard for them to stand out. Also, and this is just my personal preference, I almost never like tilted images. You''ll find tastes varying on that pretty wildly. :)<br/> <br/>If I were in this room taking a photograph to depict shapes I''d group the bottles together and shoot them from the top, with the repetition in the lids/shapes of the bottles, and then the variety in the colors. But that''s me. This is your picture, and you did a fine job taking it if it''s the way you like it.</td>', 'Actually at this angle they''re ellipses or ovals. ;) I like the repetition with the paint bottles, but the level of extraneous information in the shot, as well as the fact that the rims of the bowls are interrupted, makes it hard for them to stand out. Also, and this is just my personal preference, I almost never like tilted images. You''ll find tastes varying on that pretty wildly. :) If I were in this room taking a photograph to depict shapes I''d group the bottles together and shoot them from the top, with the repetition in the lids/shapes of the bottles, and then the variety in the colors. But that''s me. This is your picture, and you did a fine job taking it if it''s the way you like it.', '2006-01-05 02:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005779, 274356, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh dear. It''s a shame it''s not in focus and the image looks a little pixelated. People will be really hard on you about that and some of them can be pretty mean (trust me I KNOW on this. I don''t remember if I''m anonymous or not. If I''m not, check out the ''mantis'' image in my profile. oh the beating I took.). Don''t let them make you give up. Keep trying. This shot had a lot of potential.<br/> <br/>And merry (late) Christmas to you too. :)</td>', 'Oh dear. It''s a shame it''s not in focus and the image looks a little pixelated. People will be really hard on you about that and some of them can be pretty mean (trust me I KNOW on this. I don''t remember if I''m anonymous or not. If I''m not, check out the ''mantis'' image in my profile. oh the beating I took.). Don''t let them make you give up. Keep trying. This shot had a lot of potential. And merry (late) Christmas to you too. :)', '2006-01-05 02:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005784, 274204, 47487, '<td valign="top">Simple. I like it. The only issues are the highlight on the table surface on the left-hand side and the line of table edge (?) that goes diagonally across the frame. But this is a very good idea, and I love the shadows on the bowl itself.</td>', 'Simple. I like it. The only issues are the highlight on the table surface on the left-hand side and the line of table edge (?) that goes diagonally across the frame. But this is a very good idea, and I love the shadows on the bowl itself.', '2006-01-05 02:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005785, 274255, 47487, '<td valign="top">wow. Striking. Great symmetry.</td>', 'wow. Striking. Great symmetry.', '2006-01-05 02:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005786, 275210, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is a classic macro shot. I do wish the top of his eye and upper lashes weren''t cut off, though. Good reflection in the eye, and nice lighting.</td>', 'This is a classic macro shot. I do wish the top of his eye and upper lashes weren''t cut off, though. Good reflection in the eye, and nice lighting.', '2006-01-05 02:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005788, 274945, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2006-01-05 02:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005789, 276145, 47487, '<td valign="top">With so much competing for the eye''s attention, the reflected shapes unfortunately don''t stand out very much. A far tighter crop might have been better for this particular challenge, although overall this is a very pleasing and visually interesting shot. 7</td>', 'With so much competing for the eye''s attention, the reflected shapes unfortunately don''t stand out very much. A far tighter crop might have been better for this particular challenge, although overall this is a very pleasing and visually interesting shot. 7', '2006-01-05 02:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005790, 274322, 45857, '<td valign="top">Dominate shape, wonderful colors</td>', 'Dominate shape, wonderful colors', '2006-01-05 02:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005796, 276394, 47487, '<td valign="top">A nice food shot, although it would have been more interesting IMO if the top and bottom had not been cut off (maybe a vertical orientation?). The black background and the reflections are very nice, with the vivid colors. Not so much shapes that grab the viewer''s attention, though.</td>', 'A nice food shot, although it would have been more interesting IMO if the top and bottom had not been cut off (maybe a vertical orientation?). The black background and the reflections are very nice, with the vivid colors. Not so much shapes that grab the viewer''s attention, though.', '2006-01-05 02:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005797, 276284, 47487, '<td valign="top">NICE. this is a really pleasing high-key image with interesting lighting and shadows. Sublime. 10.</td>', 'NICE. this is a really pleasing high-key image with interesting lighting and shadows. Sublime. 10.', '2006-01-05 02:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005798, 276088, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2006-01-05 02:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005800, 274359, 47487, '<td valign="top">bummer about the light object in the upper right. Otherwise a really striking image, although I''m bothered by curiosity about what makes the liquid look white. :) 7.</td>', 'bummer about the light object in the upper right. Otherwise a really striking image, although I''m bothered by curiosity about what makes the liquid look white. :) 7.', '2006-01-05 02:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005802, 276281, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting location, and I like the detail on the rocks.</td>', 'Interesting location, and I like the detail on the rocks.', '2006-01-05 02:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005803, 274672, 47487, '<td valign="top">I could be totally mistaken but this has an overprocessed look to it, to me. Still, visually it''s very striking and i love the light. 7.</td>', 'I could be totally mistaken but this has an overprocessed look to it, to me. Still, visually it''s very striking and i love the light. 7.', '2006-01-05 02:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005808, 274413, 47487, '<td valign="top">For this particular challenge, it might have been better to include the whole shape of the sign, although I can see how it''s a more interesting composition in general without them. hmm.</td>', 'For this particular challenge, it might have been better to include the whole shape of the sign, although I can see how it''s a more interesting composition in general without them. hmm.', '2006-01-05 02:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005811, 274655, 47487, '<td valign="top">BLISS. Exactly the kind of image I was hoping for in this challenge. Beautifully done. 9 because it looks the TEENIEST bit grainy to me.</td>', 'BLISS. Exactly the kind of image I was hoping for in this challenge. Beautifully done. 9 because it looks the TEENIEST bit grainy to me.', '2006-01-05 02:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005814, 273733, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh sheesh, there''s one in just about every challenge. Ha ha. Giving it a 7 even though I find it in poor taste, because it meets the challenge spot-on, is funny, and is decently composed. Focus on the tangerines is a bit off, though.</td>', 'Oh sheesh, there''s one in just about every challenge. Ha ha. Giving it a 7 even though I find it in poor taste, because it meets the challenge spot-on, is funny, and is decently composed. Focus on the tangerines is a bit off, though.', '2006-01-05 02:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005819, 276330, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is well-composed and prettily lit with a nice blank background, but when it comes down to it it''s just a photograph of an object because the object fits the challenge. This gets a 7 for being well-done.</td>', 'This is well-composed and prettily lit with a nice blank background, but when it comes down to it it''s just a photograph of an object because the object fits the challenge. This gets a 7 for being well-done.', '2006-01-05 02:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005820, 276428, 47487, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject, sharp, good choice of background and even border. Meets the challenge spot-on in my opinion. 9.</td>', 'Excellent subject, sharp, good choice of background and even border. Meets the challenge spot-on in my opinion. 9.', '2006-01-05 02:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005822, 273748, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2006-01-05 02:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005823, 276423, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed with pleasing depth of field. The colors are good too.</td>', 'Nicely composed with pleasing depth of field. The colors are good too.', '2006-01-05 02:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005824, 273803, 47487, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the local teenagers make fun of it but I love things like that -- seems like something from a different era(?). Well-composed.</td>', 'I''m sure the local teenagers make fun of it but I love things like that -- seems like something from a different era(?). Well-composed.', '2006-01-05 03:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005825, 275092, 47487, '<td valign="top">Striking. I like it.</td>', 'Striking. I like it.', '2006-01-05 03:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005827, 276318, 47487, '<td valign="top">That''s brave, and seems very tasteful even to this prudish voter. Focus is excellent and I like the composition. 8 from me.</td>', 'That''s brave, and seems very tasteful even to this prudish voter. Focus is excellent and I like the composition. 8 from me.', '2006-01-05 03:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005829, 273667, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject! I think this image might have been better with a tighter crop -- maybe a closeup one of the clusters in its entirety with maybe parts of a couple/few others. The wood table is also a bit distracting with its lines -- I find a plain black t-shirt or a length of dark or white fabric helpful in situations like this. :)  This is a nice effort.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject! I think this image might have been better with a tighter crop -- maybe a closeup one of the clusters in its entirety with maybe parts of a couple/few others. The wood table is also a bit distracting with its lines -- I find a plain black t-shirt or a length of dark or white fabric helpful in situations like this. :)  This is a nice effort.', '2006-01-05 03:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005831, 274215, 47487, '<td valign="top">I''m giving a lot of leeway on this because it''s largely to do with artistic expression and personal taste, but for this particular challenge I think this would have been better composed if it showed one orange in its full roundness. I like the feeling of depth in this image, but the b/w is a bit perplexing -- seems like it would have really popped in color.</td>', 'I''m giving a lot of leeway on this because it''s largely to do with artistic expression and personal taste, but for this particular challenge I think this would have been better composed if it showed one orange in its full roundness. I like the feeling of depth in this image, but the b/w is a bit perplexing -- seems like it would have really popped in color.', '2006-01-05 03:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005833, 274636, 47487, '<td valign="top">This could be an interesting sunset picture -- I like the curve of the road -- but for this challenge I don''t think it really fits very well. Also, it''s a bit painful to look at the middle of it with the brightness.</td>', 'This could be an interesting sunset picture -- I like the curve of the road -- but for this challenge I don''t think it really fits very well. Also, it''s a bit painful to look at the middle of it with the brightness.', '2006-01-05 03:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005835, 275639, 47487, '<td valign="top">Both. I like.</td>', 'Both. I like.', '2006-01-05 03:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005837, 275145, 47487, '<td valign="top">The subject is photographed well, although in and of itself it lacks much real interest. I do like the light/reflections.</td>', 'The subject is photographed well, although in and of itself it lacks much real interest. I do like the light/reflections.', '2006-01-05 03:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005838, 276334, 47487, '<td valign="top">I was thinking, "Nice!" even before I saw the title, but when I did, the camel just jumped out at me. Well, not literally; that would be pretty startling, wouldn''t it. ;) I like the light on the tips of the foreground bushes, and the sky contrasts nicely with the subject.</td>', 'I was thinking, "Nice!" even before I saw the title, but when I did, the camel just jumped out at me. Well, not literally; that would be pretty startling, wouldn''t it. ;) I like the light on the tips of the foreground bushes, and the sky contrasts nicely with the subject.', '2006-01-05 03:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005839, 276264, 47487, '<td valign="top">Simple. I like it. The spot of light at the top is a bit distracting, but I don''t imagine you could have helped that.</td>', 'Simple. I like it. The spot of light at the top is a bit distracting, but I don''t imagine you could have helped that.', '2006-01-05 03:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005843, 273827, 47487, '<td valign="top">It''s quite hazy, unfortunately, and a more interesting angle would have made for a better photograph (as far as this challenge is concerned) with fewer distractions, I think. (the GG bridge is quite striking head-on, I''ve found.)</td>', 'It''s quite hazy, unfortunately, and a more interesting angle would have made for a better photograph (as far as this challenge is concerned) with fewer distractions, I think. (the GG bridge is quite striking head-on, I''ve found.)', '2006-01-05 03:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005845, 275973, 47487, '<td valign="top">Brilliant title; all are suggested here. Also just a stunning image in general. 10.</td>', 'Brilliant title; all are suggested here. Also just a stunning image in general. 10.', '2006-01-05 03:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005847, 274900, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject! one of the more original-looking entries I''ve come across so far. The b/w is a good choice here, I think.</td>', 'Interesting subject! one of the more original-looking entries I''ve come across so far. The b/w is a good choice here, I think.', '2006-01-05 03:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005848, 273817, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, even nicer waves in the background. This is a really good image.</td>', 'Nice silhouette, even nicer waves in the background. This is a really good image.', '2006-01-05 03:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005849, 274151, 47487, '<td valign="top">Would have been bliss if it hadn''t been grainy, in my opinion (although it looks as though you did the grain on purpose -- just my personal preference). What a great idea and good composition. Clever title too. ;)</td>', 'Would have been bliss if it hadn''t been grainy, in my opinion (although it looks as though you did the grain on purpose -- just my personal preference). What a great idea and good composition. Clever title too. ;)', '2006-01-05 03:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005850, 276037, 47487, '<td valign="top">Visually interesting; great colors.</td>', 'Visually interesting; great colors.', '2006-01-05 03:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005852, 274099, 47377, '<td valign="top">excelletn idea. I think i would have prefered to see the front piece in better focus and also there seems to be something missing in the top left corner. I think I would have liked to have seen the chocolate dissapear out of the picture instead of stopping short of the edge. 6</td>', 'excelletn idea. I think i would have prefered to see the front piece in better focus and also there seems to be something missing in the top left corner. I think I would have liked to have seen the chocolate dissapear out of the picture instead of stopping short of the edge. 6', '2006-01-05 03:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005861, 276169, 44611, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and light.  This is super.</td>', 'Excellent composition and light.  This is super.', '2006-01-05 03:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005867, 275919, 44611, '<td valign="top">A good concept for the theme, but it would have been good if your submission was larger as it is difficult to ascertain detail from your small image.</td>', 'A good concept for the theme, but it would have been good if your submission was larger as it is difficult to ascertain detail from your small image.', '2006-01-05 03:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005876, 275152, 44611, '<td valign="top">I love the wispy, ethereal feel of this image.  A good capture of unusual clouds.</td>', 'I love the wispy, ethereal feel of this image.  A good capture of unusual clouds.', '2006-01-05 03:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005880, 276171, 44611, '<td valign="top">A great concept and well captured.  However, I find the slight tilt distracting and feel this would have benefited from being better defined without the border.  I appreciate that the border is very small, but I think because it''s white, it is stopping the eye''s progress to the light at the centre of the image.</td>', 'A great concept and well captured.  However, I find the slight tilt distracting and feel this would have benefited from being better defined without the border.  I appreciate that the border is very small, but I think because it''s white, it is stopping the eye''s progress to the light at the centre of the image.', '2006-01-05 03:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005887, 275290, 38509, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2006-01-05 03:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005888, 275710, 44611, '<td valign="top">The colour piping is great - the silver ball (is that what it is?) seems out of place.</td>', 'The colour piping is great - the silver ball (is that what it is?) seems out of place.', '2006-01-05 03:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
