(2006489, 275947, 31533, '<td valign="top">too small</td>', 'too small', '2006-01-05 09:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006492, 276401, 39566, '<td valign="top">wish it was a little bigger, but very good</td>', 'wish it was a little bigger, but very good', '2006-01-05 09:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006497, 273902, 39566, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2006-01-05 09:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006498, 276013, 45857, '<td valign="top">Your image does contain strong shapes, but for me they seem more a distraction than the focal point. I think the points at the hand and head where the drinker get lost in the background are also weaknesses.</td>', 'Your image does contain strong shapes, but for me they seem more a distraction than the focal point. I think the points at the hand and head where the drinker get lost in the background are also weaknesses.', '2006-01-05 09:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006499, 274672, 39566, '<td valign="top">amazing photo..great detail</td>', 'amazing photo..great detail', '2006-01-05 09:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006501, 273921, 41999, '<td valign="top">Good: diagonal orientaion<br/>Less than good: centered composition, blown-out highlight, no real blacks<br/> <br/>Would fixing these things make this a good photo? Probably for a "Minimalism" challenge, but not for "Shapes."</td>', 'Good: diagonal orientaionLess than good: centered composition, blown-out highlight, no real blacks Would fixing these things make this a good photo? Probably for a "Minimalism" challenge, but not for "Shapes."', '2006-01-05 09:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006507, 276473, 39566, '<td valign="top">this is a really cool photo</td>', 'this is a really cool photo', '2006-01-05 09:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006509, 273572, 48236, '<td valign="top">Looks neat.....what is it??</td>', 'Looks neat.....what is it??', '2006-01-05 09:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006514, 273731, 41999, '<td valign="top">Love the right edge...wish at least half of the left edge were cropped...i.e., less centered.</td>', 'Love the right edge...wish at least half of the left edge were cropped...i.e., less centered.', '2006-01-05 09:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006517, 273899, 45857, '<td valign="top">Definitely on topic. I wonder if the even simplier backside would have been stronger.</td>', 'Definitely on topic. I wonder if the even simplier backside would have been stronger.', '2006-01-05 09:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006519, 274631, 41999, '<td valign="top">Good lighting!</td>', 'Good lighting!', '2006-01-05 09:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006520, 276022, 39566, '<td valign="top">very awesome..how''d you do that</td>', 'very awesome..how''d you do that', '2006-01-05 09:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006522, 273733, 15711, '<td valign="top">This looks like something in an ad campaign. Interesting and kind of funny!!!</td>', 'This looks like something in an ad campaign. Interesting and kind of funny!!!', '2006-01-05 09:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006523, 274198, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the the idea of this but it seems way underexposed.</td>', 'I like the the idea of this but it seems way underexposed.', '2006-01-05 09:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006524, 275179, 48236, '<td valign="top">Love the angle</td>', 'Love the angle', '2006-01-05 09:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006527, 276477, 41999, '<td valign="top">Super DOF.</td>', 'Super DOF.', '2006-01-05 10:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006528, 275312, 39566, '<td valign="top">this is really cool, deserves a ribbon for sure</td>', 'this is really cool, deserves a ribbon for sure', '2006-01-05 10:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006529, 276346, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice title. I like the shadow and light play.  Great detail. This macro works for me. It would look cool with a big off white mat, framed in a rough cedar frame that has barbed wire on it. I can see it hanging in a barbeque restaurant or dude ranch mess hall.</td>', 'Nice title. I like the shadow and light play.  Great detail. This macro works for me. It would look cool with a big off white mat, framed in a rough cedar frame that has barbed wire on it. I can see it hanging in a barbeque restaurant or dude ranch mess hall.', '2006-01-05 10:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006530, 275369, 39566, '<td valign="top">very awesome deserves a ribbon</td>', 'very awesome deserves a ribbon', '2006-01-05 10:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006533, 275159, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice crisp image but kind of leaves me blah. The lighting and detail are fine, but the subject isn''t very interesting. Hmmm - what do marbles have to do with love? LOL  6</td>', 'This is a really nice crisp image but kind of leaves me blah. The lighting and detail are fine, but the subject isn''t very interesting. Hmmm - what do marbles have to do with love? LOL  6', '2006-01-05 10:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006534, 276330, 15711, '<td valign="top">Man, now I''ll be thinking of that Lovin'' Spoonfuls song all day.  This is interesting.  I wish it weren''t so soft.  I think if it were tack sharp it''d work better for me.  Maybe a dark background. Hmmm - just thinking out loud.</td>', 'Man, now I''ll be thinking of that Lovin'' Spoonfuls song all day.  This is interesting.  I wish it weren''t so soft.  I think if it were tack sharp it''d work better for me.  Maybe a dark background. Hmmm - just thinking out loud.', '2006-01-05 10:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006535, 274672, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool, love the metalic field to this. One of my favourites!</td>', 'Cool, love the metalic field to this. One of my favourites!', '2006-01-05 10:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006537, 274255, 15711, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of those "what do you see? the face or the vase" images. THe outline of the profile seems scratchy. Maybe too much unsharp mask? I do like the idea of it and the stark black and white is good.</td>', 'This makes me think of those "what do you see? the face or the vase" images. THe outline of the profile seems scratchy. Maybe too much unsharp mask? I do like the idea of it and the stark black and white is good.', '2006-01-05 10:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006539, 275710, 41999, '<td valign="top">I believe the ball bearing detracts, rather than adds to the composition. But you are right that something besides the colored thingies is needed.</td>', 'I believe the ball bearing detracts, rather than adds to the composition. But you are right that something besides the colored thingies is needed.', '2006-01-05 10:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006540, 275089, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is cool and abstract.  What if you brought up the saturation of the purple a bit more?  Just a thought.  I do like it.</td>', 'Oh this is cool and abstract.  What if you brought up the saturation of the purple a bit more?  Just a thought.  I do like it.', '2006-01-05 10:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006542, 275296, 15711, '<td valign="top">Man, tack sharp! The lighting is good and I like the screen he''s sitting on.</td>', 'Man, tack sharp! The lighting is good and I like the screen he''s sitting on.', '2006-01-05 10:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006546, 274672, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the silvery cast to it with that touch of blue. Sand and water make some really fun shapes and you captured a nice image of some of them. If it had a single bird, or starfish or shell to add one addition touch, that would really make it for me.</td>', 'I like the silvery cast to it with that touch of blue. Sand and water make some really fun shapes and you captured a nice image of some of them. If it had a single bird, or starfish or shell to add one addition touch, that would really make it for me.', '2006-01-05 10:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006548, 276264, 41999, '<td valign="top">Good example of a combination of similar shapes (steps) forming a compound shape (stair).</td>', 'Good example of a combination of similar shapes (steps) forming a compound shape (stair).', '2006-01-05 10:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006550, 276470, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a lovely vista.  I wonder if you played with contrast, if it wouldn''t have even more pow.  I''m a big fan of really saturated colors and the blues could use a touch of that in my opinion. Makes me want to go put on my coat!!!</td>', 'What a lovely vista.  I wonder if you played with contrast, if it wouldn''t have even more pow.  I''m a big fan of really saturated colors and the blues could use a touch of that in my opinion. Makes me want to go put on my coat!!!', '2006-01-05 10:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006551, 276473, 39410, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the shapes in this building, and the bright blue reflections in the lower window but the lighting isn''t great. Perhaps shooting at a different time of day with the sun at a better angle would help.</td>', 'I like the composition, the shapes in this building, and the bright blue reflections in the lower window but the lighting isn''t great. Perhaps shooting at a different time of day with the sun at a better angle would help.', '2006-01-05 10:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006552, 276149, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would really make a cool image to me if it didn''t have the "chopped off at the bottom" sense. Maybe have it to one side with a solid black background and the light coming from one direction with some more negative space around it. The vase is cool but as it is, kind of leaves me uninspired.</td>', 'This would really make a cool image to me if it didn''t have the "chopped off at the bottom" sense. Maybe have it to one side with a solid black background and the light coming from one direction with some more negative space around it. The vase is cool but as it is, kind of leaves me uninspired.', '2006-01-05 10:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006553, 273446, 46885, '<td valign="top">What a pleasant photo, but what an illogical addition of the lightbulb!</td>', 'What a pleasant photo, but what an illogical addition of the lightbulb!', '2006-01-05 10:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006554, 275649, 39410, '<td valign="top">Small images are very hard to judge. This one just looks a little too cluttered.</td>', 'Small images are very hard to judge. This one just looks a little too cluttered.', '2006-01-05 10:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006556, 275901, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The lighting skimming over the different areas makes for some interest. The use of negative space is good.</td>', 'I like this.  The lighting skimming over the different areas makes for some interest. The use of negative space is good.', '2006-01-05 10:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006558, 274854, 41999, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The over-sharpening is a graphic element in itself.</td>', 'Very nice. The over-sharpening is a graphic element in itself.', '2006-01-05 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006560, 274502, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the Magnetix. I think it might serve you better if it weren''t target centered, and had negative space to one side. The shadow is cool.</td>', 'I like the use of the Magnetix. I think it might serve you better if it weren''t target centered, and had negative space to one side. The shadow is cool.', '2006-01-05 10:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006561, 276187, 50715, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but it''s turned out as a bit of a nothing photo.  A few variations that might improve it:<br/>- Make the hands more out of focus.  They seem to be almost, but not quite, in focus, which is distracting.  Make it clear that you''ve deliberately made it out of focus rather than leaving us wondering if it was a mistake.<br/>- Leave the hands out of focus, but make the shadow in focus, or nearly so.<br/>- Photograph only the shadow, not the hands.<br/> <br/>Making the photo monochrome was definitely the right thing to do though!</td>', 'Interesting idea, but it''s turned out as a bit of a nothing photo.  A few variations that might improve it:- Make the hands more out of focus.  They seem to be almost, but not quite, in focus, which is distracting.  Make it clear that you''ve deliberately made it out of focus rather than leaving us wondering if it was a mistake.- Leave the hands out of focus, but make the shadow in focus, or nearly so.- Photograph only the shadow, not the hands. Making the photo monochrome was definitely the right thing to do though!', '2006-01-05 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006563, 273905, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think for this to really work, the focus needs to be tack sharp. As it is, the blur just kind of makes you think of a snapshot. It has potential to be really artful.</td>', 'I think for this to really work, the focus needs to be tack sharp. As it is, the blur just kind of makes you think of a snapshot. It has potential to be really artful.', '2006-01-05 10:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006565, 273669, 39410, '<td valign="top">I really like this type of shot with the grass, water, and reflections. The composition is beautiful. I don''t, however, like the diffused look. It make the grass look too soft. It is also just a little grey for my taste.</td>', 'I really like this type of shot with the grass, water, and reflections. The composition is beautiful. I don''t, however, like the diffused look. It make the grass look too soft. It is also just a little grey for my taste.', '2006-01-05 10:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006566, 275069, 15711, '<td valign="top">THis is pretty with the duplicity of it. I like the crop and lighting.</td>', 'THis is pretty with the duplicity of it. I like the crop and lighting.', '2006-01-05 10:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006567, 274199, 46885, '<td valign="top">Are those drinking cups? If so, very neat visual trick!</td>', 'Are those drinking cups? If so, very neat visual trick!', '2006-01-05 10:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006568, 274292, 15711, '<td valign="top">THis is very abstract. Not sure if it has enough interest to really do well, but the detail is nice.  Unfortunately, nobody would know what it is without the title.</td>', 'THis is very abstract. Not sure if it has enough interest to really do well, but the detail is nice.  Unfortunately, nobody would know what it is without the title.', '2006-01-05 10:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006570, 273817, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS! That hint of lit umbrella gives your eye another place to look.  This is well done!!! 8</td>', 'LOVE THIS! That hint of lit umbrella gives your eye another place to look.  This is well done!!! 8', '2006-01-05 10:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006573, 274057, 39410, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful, but it is color and not shape that dominates this image. Also, there is no strong point of focus.</td>', 'The colors are beautiful, but it is color and not shape that dominates this image. Also, there is no strong point of focus.', '2006-01-05 10:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006575, 276454, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool. I like the contrast.</td>', 'This is kind of cool. I like the contrast.', '2006-01-05 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006576, 276068, 50715, '<td valign="top">She''s a nice looking girl, but the photo does nothing for me, sorry.  I can''t see any focus on shape here - certainly can''t say that shape is the most important aspect of this photo.  Too many different shapes - some round, some angular, but no connection between the different angles, shapes or curves.  The shadow looks like it''s an accident - it would be very different if the shadow had nice clean lines that obviously echoed the model.</td>', 'She''s a nice looking girl, but the photo does nothing for me, sorry.  I can''t see any focus on shape here - certainly can''t say that shape is the most important aspect of this photo.  Too many different shapes - some round, some angular, but no connection between the different angles, shapes or curves.  The shadow looks like it''s an accident - it would be very different if the shadow had nice clean lines that obviously echoed the model.', '2006-01-05 10:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006578, 275290, 39410, '<td valign="top">Strong composition. Next time, skip the border. It ruins an otherwise lovely shot for me.</td>', 'Strong composition. Next time, skip the border. It ruins an otherwise lovely shot for me.', '2006-01-05 10:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006582, 274720, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. It has a tiny bit of softness - probably due to the bright light.  This is stunning.  The shallow DOF is good too. Great detailing of the intricacies of the shell. This may be my fav of the challenge. 9</td>', 'Beautiful. It has a tiny bit of softness - probably due to the bright light.  This is stunning.  The shallow DOF is good too. Great detailing of the intricacies of the shell. This may be my fav of the challenge. 9', '2006-01-05 10:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006583, 273576, 41999, '<td valign="top">Good: Interesting ceiling light<br/>Less than good: centered composition, blown-out highlights, no true blacks<br/> <br/>Would fixing these things make this a GOOD picture? Maybe, I''m not sure.</td>', 'Good: Interesting ceiling lightLess than good: centered composition, blown-out highlights, no true blacks Would fixing these things make this a GOOD picture? Maybe, I''m not sure.', '2006-01-05 10:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006587, 276170, 48236, '<td valign="top">There must be every shape that you can imagine here!!</td>', 'There must be every shape that you can imagine here!!', '2006-01-05 10:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006588, 276068, 15711, '<td valign="top">"Getting in Shape " might have been a better title.  I''d crop just below the shirt - the webbed belt is a tad distracting and takes away from the work out sense for me. I like the movement of her hair and the contrast is good.</td>', '"Getting in Shape " might have been a better title.  I''d crop just below the shirt - the webbed belt is a tad distracting and takes away from the work out sense for me. I like the movement of her hair and the contrast is good.', '2006-01-05 10:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006591, 276473, 15711, '<td valign="top">THis is lovely with the deep blue in the window. Very interesting. The symmetry is a nice touch.  It seems a touch dark, which I usually like, but maybe playing with contrast would fix that. 7</td>', 'THis is lovely with the deep blue in the window. Very interesting. The symmetry is a nice touch.  It seems a touch dark, which I usually like, but maybe playing with contrast would fix that. 7', '2006-01-05 10:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006592, 276013, 39410, '<td valign="top">Overall, the lighting is good. I like the silhouette holding the glass. I find the bright rectangle to the right very distracting as it keeps pulling me away from the drinker. It is also the strongest "shape" in the image but does not appear to be the primary focus.</td>', 'Overall, the lighting is good. I like the silhouette holding the glass. I find the bright rectangle to the right very distracting as it keeps pulling me away from the drinker. It is also the strongest "shape" in the image but does not appear to be the primary focus.', '2006-01-05 10:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006595, 275973, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT TITLE. I love this.  The silvery light on the blue sky and water is gorgeous. Nicely captured.</td>', 'GREAT TITLE. I love this.  The silvery light on the blue sky and water is gorgeous. Nicely captured.', '2006-01-05 10:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006597, 275310, 41999, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm..what''s in the box? Rattlesnake, scorpion...?</td>', 'Hmmmm..what''s in the box? Rattlesnake, scorpion...?', '2006-01-05 10:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006599, 276471, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this would serve you better if the lighting were better. It kind of gets lost in the dark as it is.</td>', 'I think this would serve you better if the lighting were better. It kind of gets lost in the dark as it is.', '2006-01-05 10:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006601, 274593, 39410, '<td valign="top">The composition is good. The highlights are a little blown in the top right, but I am not too bothered by that. Actually, I would like to see even more contrast in this shot.</td>', 'The composition is good. The highlights are a little blown in the top right, but I am not too bothered by that. Actually, I would like to see even more contrast in this shot.', '2006-01-05 10:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006602, 273831, 48236, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!', '2006-01-05 10:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006605, 274679, 15711, '<td valign="top">Something about bicycle wheels are very appealing to me. I like this. Has an old timey sense to it with the sepia filter.</td>', 'Something about bicycle wheels are very appealing to me. I like this. Has an old timey sense to it with the sepia filter.', '2006-01-05 10:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006607, 273446, 39410, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The composition is okay, but I would likk to see the glass bulb more clearly, perhaps with less reflection from all the overhead lighting.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The composition is okay, but I would likk to see the glass bulb more clearly, perhaps with less reflection from all the overhead lighting.', '2006-01-05 10:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006609, 274198, 45857, '<td valign="top">There are so many things to enjoy in ths image; the diagonals that lead you around and around, the multi-level hues of the mountains, the vertical repetition of the windmills. The problem is nothing screams shape and I''m left with linearities and patterns. Keeping the topic in mind, I can''t score this as much as I like it.</td>', 'There are so many things to enjoy in ths image; the diagonals that lead you around and around, the multi-level hues of the mountains, the vertical repetition of the windmills. The problem is nothing screams shape and I''m left with linearities and patterns. Keeping the topic in mind, I can''t score this as much as I like it.', '2006-01-05 10:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006613, 273555, 44607, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice minimalistic shot....I like it:-)</td>', 'This is a very nice minimalistic shot....I like it:-)', '2006-01-05 10:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006614, 276421, 39410, '<td valign="top">This shot is one of those that I wish I could see bigger to study all the fine detail.</td>', 'This shot is one of those that I wish I could see bigger to study all the fine detail.', '2006-01-05 10:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006616, 274996, 41999, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2006-01-05 10:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006622, 273659, 39410, '<td valign="top">Good find, but I am not sure the shape is strong enough to be a high-scorer in this challenge. The image is also a little dull and could use with some curve/levels adjustment to add more contrast, darken the shadows, and brighten the snow just a bit.</td>', 'Good find, but I am not sure the shape is strong enough to be a high-scorer in this challenge. The image is also a little dull and could use with some curve/levels adjustment to add more contrast, darken the shadows, and brighten the snow just a bit.', '2006-01-05 10:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006631, 275687, 44607, '<td valign="top">Amazing metallic feeling and composition.</td>', 'Amazing metallic feeling and composition.', '2006-01-05 10:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006636, 275641, 39410, '<td valign="top">I wish your sphere was a little more prominent in this shot. It is not clear what it is (a coconut perhaps?) or why it makes the holder so happy. (Great expression though.) Also the coloring is a little drab.</td>', 'I wish your sphere was a little more prominent in this shot. It is not clear what it is (a coconut perhaps?) or why it makes the holder so happy. (Great expression though.) Also the coloring is a little drab.', '2006-01-05 10:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006644, 275678, 45857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ''F/64'' landscape. Love the sky and the tonal range, and the way the diagonal leads you down to the tree. However, the complex grayscale on the neutral sky speaks to me more about textures than shapes, therefore I have to score this down for the topic.</td>', 'Beautiful ''F/64'' landscape. Love the sky and the tonal range, and the way the diagonal leads you down to the tree. However, the complex grayscale on the neutral sky speaks to me more about textures than shapes, therefore I have to score this down for the topic.', '2006-01-05 10:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006649, 276470, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I do not think the shape of the mountains is the most important aspect.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I do not think the shape of the mountains is the most important aspect.', '2006-01-05 10:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006650, 276451, 39410, '<td valign="top">How early are they teaching trig these days? She looks so young. Nice concept. I''m not sure the black and white adds anything to this image.</td>', 'How early are they teaching trig these days? She looks so young. Nice concept. I''m not sure the black and white adds anything to this image.', '2006-01-05 10:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006659, 274767, 44607, '<td valign="top">I think that the color ring alone is beautifull....I just dont like the contrast between the two rings...a 7</td>', 'I think that the color ring alone is beautifull....I just dont like the contrast between the two rings...a 7', '2006-01-05 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006662, 275930, 39410, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic form on this one, but it looks like it crosses the border from photography to digital art. It is a beautiful image, but I wouldn''t call it a great photograph.</td>', 'I like the graphic form on this one, but it looks like it crosses the border from photography to digital art. It is a beautiful image, but I wouldn''t call it a great photograph.', '2006-01-05 10:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006664, 275929, 43565, '<td valign="top">For me, this shot is too busy--too much pattern, too many objects.  It also does not seem that the shapes are the most important aspect.</td>', 'For me, this shot is too busy--too much pattern, too many objects.  It also does not seem that the shapes are the most important aspect.', '2006-01-05 10:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006667, 274146, 39410, '<td valign="top">The exposure on this one is off. The sky is over exposed, but the detail is still lost in the shadows of the tree. It is not completely silhouetted, but yet the texture is not clear either. Also, all the other trees around detract from the "shape" of this one.</td>', 'The exposure on this one is off. The sky is over exposed, but the detail is still lost in the shadows of the tree. It is not completely silhouetted, but yet the texture is not clear either. Also, all the other trees around detract from the "shape" of this one.', '2006-01-05 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006668, 273902, 44607, '<td valign="top">You cut the top and the left part of the building.....and it does not work in this picture....a 6</td>', 'You cut the top and the left part of the building.....and it does not work in this picture....a 6', '2006-01-05 10:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006670, 275459, 44607, '<td valign="top">Very creative!!!!!</td>', 'Very creative!!!!!', '2006-01-05 10:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006671, 274058, 39410, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the lighting or the focus in this shot. It would be better if you could have kept the full roll on the left in the frame. Also, there is a white border down the left side that doesn''t look like it belongs there.</td>', 'I don''t like the lighting or the focus in this shot. It would be better if you could have kept the full roll on the left in the frame. Also, there is a white border down the left side that doesn''t look like it belongs there.', '2006-01-05 10:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006674, 274200, 45857, '<td valign="top">Tough image to score. You start with two strong shapes, the apples and the vase,then unfortunately you confuse the shape of the apples with the pattern/texture of the vase. The vase gets lost in the background, because it''s pattern works as camoflauge, breaking up the outline. Finally, I just don''t like the green apples on the blue-gray background</td>', 'Tough image to score. You start with two strong shapes, the apples and the vase,then unfortunately you confuse the shape of the apples with the pattern/texture of the vase. The vase gets lost in the background, because it''s pattern works as camoflauge, breaking up the outline. Finally, I just don''t like the green apples on the blue-gray background', '2006-01-05 10:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006676, 273810, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that shape is the most important aspect of this shot.  For me, the focus could be better and it might have looked better on a dark background.</td>', 'I don''t think that shape is the most important aspect of this shot.  For me, the focus could be better and it might have looked better on a dark background.', '2006-01-05 10:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006677, 276311, 44607, '<td valign="top">Good angle I think...and beautifull contrast between the white and the blue and the shadows.</td>', 'Good angle I think...and beautifull contrast between the white and the blue and the shadows.', '2006-01-05 10:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006683, 274322, 44607, '<td valign="top">Great colors!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Great colors!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2006-01-05 10:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006684, 273817, 39410, '<td valign="top">I like the way the sun is reflecting off the umbrella giving a little dimension to the silhouette. The sky and water are both a little grey, which may be accurate of the scene, but doesn''t have a lot of impact. Also, there is an odd little blotch in the sky to the right of the subject''s face. I used to get those in my skies with my old camera. Very annoying. I never figured out the source. Anyway, nice image. - 7</td>', 'I like the way the sun is reflecting off the umbrella giving a little dimension to the silhouette. The sky and water are both a little grey, which may be accurate of the scene, but doesn''t have a lot of impact. Also, there is an odd little blotch in the sky to the right of the subject''s face. I used to get those in my skies with my old camera. Very annoying. I never figured out the source. Anyway, nice image. - 7', '2006-01-05 10:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006685, 273921, 32084, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and IMO one of the few good takes on the challenge.  Maybe next time move alittle off center and go after that hot spot in the center of the lught.</td>', 'Neat idea and IMO one of the few good takes on the challenge.  Maybe next time move alittle off center and go after that hot spot in the center of the lught.', '2006-01-05 10:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
