(2006998, 273817, 117, '<td valign="top">I hope you go over this one better with software for its a shot you can get back. Looks like you had water on the lens. Sometimes we did need to clone and fix up the seldom capture shots that we get. 8 but this one is a 10</td>', 'I hope you go over this one better with software for its a shot you can get back. Looks like you had water on the lens. Sometimes we did need to clone and fix up the seldom capture shots that we get. 8 but this one is a 10', '2006-01-05 13:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
