(2007072, 276071, 45897, '<td valign="top">Really awesome picture, love the color and SHAPES....</td>', 'Really awesome picture, love the color and SHAPES....', '2006-01-05 13:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007075, 274099, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like this. In my own personal opinion it would have been even better if the entirety of the front candy had been visible, but still a very attractive and interesting composition of an original subject.</td>', 'I like this. In my own personal opinion it would have been even better if the entirety of the front candy had been visible, but still a very attractive and interesting composition of an original subject.', '2006-01-05 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007077, 275159, 47487, '<td valign="top">Hmm. I see a shapeless corner of a presumably heart-shaped pillow, with some marbles away off in the corner of the image. Shapes-wise, this doesn''t do much for me. I do like the colors. The image is sharp, and the composition is interesting.</td>', 'Hmm. I see a shapeless corner of a presumably heart-shaped pillow, with some marbles away off in the corner of the image. Shapes-wise, this doesn''t do much for me. I do like the colors. The image is sharp, and the composition is interesting.', '2006-01-05 13:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007078, 276033, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, clever. How original. I like this.</td>', 'Oh, clever. How original. I like this.', '2006-01-05 13:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007083, 276436, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, that''s a very nice composition -- draws my eyes right down that path. The colors are vivid and the image is nie and sharp as well.</td>', 'Oh wow, that''s a very nice composition -- draws my eyes right down that path. The colors are vivid and the image is nie and sharp as well.', '2006-01-05 13:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007085, 276102, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like the textures here, and the color tones. A nice, sharp image -- the detail is excellent.</td>', 'I like the textures here, and the color tones. A nice, sharp image -- the detail is excellent.', '2006-01-05 13:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007090, 273295, 47487, '<td valign="top">Way to photograph an ordinary everyday object and make it compelling.</td>', 'Way to photograph an ordinary everyday object and make it compelling.', '2006-01-05 13:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007095, 276456, 47487, '<td valign="top">I can see that it''s the shape of the tree that''s the subject here, and this is a very nice silhouette with a beautiful background. For some reason (distractions?) the tree doesn''t pop out at me like I wish it would. This challenge aside, I think this shot <i>without</i> the tree -- with just the fence and the people and the sea -- would be truly amazing. As it is, the tree almost seems to be in the way.</td>', 'I can see that it''s the shape of the tree that''s the subject here, and this is a very nice silhouette with a beautiful background. For some reason (distractions?) the tree doesn''t pop out at me like I wish it would. This challenge aside, I think this shot without the tree -- with just the fence and the people and the sea -- would be truly amazing. As it is, the tree almost seems to be in the way.', '2006-01-05 13:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007096, 273917, 33732, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I thought the title should not use the assignment word.  But this is very appropriate.  DOF could be a little more.  What is below the bird?  Doesn''t seem to add anything.  I am sure it took time to get this photo so I am not being critical.  To bad you could not get a little more of the head.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very interesting.  I thought the title should not use the assignment word.  But this is very appropriate.  DOF could be a little more.  What is below the bird?  Doesn''t seem to add anything.  I am sure it took time to get this photo so I am not being critical.  To bad you could not get a little more of the head.  Good luck.', '2006-01-05 13:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007099, 276150, 47487, '<td valign="top">They are. :)<br/> <br/>The lighting seems a bit flat here, and frankly (man I hate to be mean in comments) the subject seems just a bit boring -- doesn''t tell me a story or grab my attention. Don''t give up, keep taking pictures and you''ll find that the more you do it, the more you find your own eye and your own style.<br/> <br/>You did meet the challenge spot-on. :)</td>', 'They are. :) The lighting seems a bit flat here, and frankly (man I hate to be mean in comments) the subject seems just a bit boring -- doesn''t tell me a story or grab my attention. Don''t give up, keep taking pictures and you''ll find that the more you do it, the more you find your own eye and your own style. You did meet the challenge spot-on. :)', '2006-01-05 13:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007100, 276033, 38670, '<td valign="top">nice silueter. nice colors. 7</td>', 'nice silueter. nice colors. 7', '2006-01-05 13:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
