(2007104, 274426, 47487, '<td valign="top">Those circles (ovals at this angle, to be precise, but whatever ;) at the bottom just jump right out at me. Good job. I like your focus decision here, with the shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Those circles (ovals at this angle, to be precise, but whatever ;) at the bottom just jump right out at me. Good job. I like your focus decision here, with the shallow depth of field.', '2006-01-05 13:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
