(2009568, 276454, 47919, '<td valign="top">My favorite image in this challenge. It''s clean, fits the challenge topic very well. I like the ambiguity between positive and negative space. There is a little room for improvement though. I think the distortions in the form made by clothing straps hurt a lot. <br/>Thanks for submitting this.</td>', 'My favorite image in this challenge. It''s clean, fits the challenge topic very well. I like the ambiguity between positive and negative space. There is a little room for improvement though. I think the distortions in the form made by clothing straps hurt a lot. Thanks for submitting this.', '2006-01-06 09:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009652, 273936, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great arrangement of an interesting variety of shapes, colors, and textures. It could make a very nice photo. I think it would be better in a square format, with the table centered. It certainly needs sharper focus, and a completely yellow yolk would be a big plus. I''m torn over the lighting; it seems too harsh for the rustic country breakfast feeling the photo exudes, yet I like the interesting shadows. I assume it was taken outdoors in sunlight. Couldn''t you have arranged for a nice cloud to soften the light? No, I don''t know how to do that either! But a white poster board set up to the left somehow would reflect back some of the sunlight and lighten the shadows.</td>', 'Great arrangement of an interesting variety of shapes, colors, and textures. It could make a very nice photo. I think it would be better in a square format, with the table centered. It certainly needs sharper focus, and a completely yellow yolk would be a big plus. I''m torn over the lighting; it seems too harsh for the rustic country breakfast feeling the photo exudes, yet I like the interesting shadows. I assume it was taken outdoors in sunlight. Couldn''t you have arranged for a nice cloud to soften the light? No, I don''t know how to do that either! But a white poster board set up to the left somehow would reflect back some of the sunlight and lighten the shadows.', '2006-01-06 10:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009659, 275408, 10402, '<td valign="top">A striking image. The lighting brings out the textures. Good black and white subject. I wish it was a little sharper.</td>', 'A striking image. The lighting brings out the textures. Good black and white subject. I wish it was a little sharper.', '2006-01-06 10:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009662, 276449, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns, but a little boring. The link near the top left is a bit different; put that on a "rule of thirds" point to add some interest.</td>', 'Nice patterns, but a little boring. The link near the top left is a bit different; put that on a "rule of thirds" point to add some interest.', '2006-01-06 10:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009664, 276311, 10402, '<td valign="top">The unique point of view makes a striking image.</td>', 'The unique point of view makes a striking image.', '2006-01-06 10:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009698, 275766, 49581, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this on a black background</td>', 'I would like to see this on a black background', '2006-01-06 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009732, 274655, 23962, '<td valign="top">Amazing. A real keeper. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Amazing. A real keeper. One of my favorites.', '2006-01-06 11:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009746, 275642, 50373, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  For this theme though, I''d experiment leaving more open space in the top left corner by shifting an image slightly to the right.  More open space would emphasize the caption.</td>', 'Great idea!  For this theme though, I''d experiment leaving more open space in the top left corner by shifting an image slightly to the right.  More open space would emphasize the caption.', '2006-01-06 11:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009755, 276145, 50373, '<td valign="top">Very powerful! Love the color saturation levels.</td>', 'Very powerful! Love the color saturation levels.', '2006-01-06 11:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009761, 276456, 50373, '<td valign="top">Powerful composition!  B&amp;W - perfect!</td>', 'Powerful composition!  B&W - perfect!', '2006-01-06 11:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009778, 276224, 32084, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for simplicity and art.  Nice job.  I wonder though why this crop leaving the top right white area.  This is not a complaint - just a ponder.</td>', 'I am a sucker for simplicity and art.  Nice job.  I wonder though why this crop leaving the top right white area.  This is not a complaint - just a ponder.', '2006-01-06 12:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009783, 275928, 33672, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting!  Very Very nice.</td>', 'Looks like a painting!  Very Very nice.', '2006-01-06 12:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009784, 275290, 16950, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Usually, I don''t mind borders, but in this case, I think it takes away from the photo a little.  Still very good. 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Usually, I don''t mind borders, but in this case, I think it takes away from the photo a little.  Still very good. 8', '2006-01-06 12:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009793, 275887, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp. The wires are distracting. Maybe less woth advanced editing...</td>', 'Nice comp. The wires are distracting. Maybe less woth advanced editing...', '2006-01-06 12:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009801, 273899, 23962, '<td valign="top">Similar to my own entry. Nice shine. Good composition.</td>', 'Similar to my own entry. Nice shine. Good composition.', '2006-01-06 12:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009806, 273669, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice gradient... Subject looks too much like a hairball.  Sorry...</td>', 'Nice gradient... Subject looks too much like a hairball.  Sorry...', '2006-01-06 12:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009815, 276224, 30841, '<td valign="top">I dig the composition</td>', 'I dig the composition', '2006-01-06 12:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009820, 276187, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think the shadow should have better focus.</td>', 'I think the shadow should have better focus.', '2006-01-06 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009821, 274113, 30841, '<td valign="top">a deeper dof would help</td>', 'a deeper dof would help', '2006-01-06 12:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009825, 274996, 30841, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea but the color isn''t sharp and you can see a crease in the paper. The shadow also reveals the curvature of your backdrop.</td>', 'I really like the idea but the color isn''t sharp and you can see a crease in the paper. The shadow also reveals the curvature of your backdrop.', '2006-01-06 12:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009833, 276171, 30841, '<td valign="top">IMHO the image would be much better with cropping to acheive symmetry. On your left margin you have about 1/8th of a circle whereas on the right margin you have about a third of the circle. The top and bottom is the same situation. If you could have taken this photo with more of the pattern, It would have been really cool to see the other dark pattern shifted to a corner of the photo in order to acheive the rule of thirds. The photo is a great idea that could be a better picture with some experimenting.</td>', 'IMHO the image would be much better with cropping to acheive symmetry. On your left margin you have about 1/8th of a circle whereas on the right margin you have about a third of the circle. The top and bottom is the same situation. If you could have taken this photo with more of the pattern, It would have been really cool to see the other dark pattern shifted to a corner of the photo in order to acheive the rule of thirds. The photo is a great idea that could be a better picture with some experimenting.', '2006-01-06 12:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009835, 276131, 30841, '<td valign="top">nice take on the challenge</td>', 'nice take on the challenge', '2006-01-06 12:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009836, 275442, 30841, '<td valign="top">great composition and lighting. 9</td>', 'great composition and lighting. 9', '2006-01-06 12:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009837, 275459, 30841, '<td valign="top">made me smile</td>', 'made me smile', '2006-01-06 12:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009838, 276369, 30841, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if the chicken wire is out of focus or that is motion blur. Would have been better with the wire all solid. I do however like the idea of the color amongst the otherwise grey tones. It would be more dramatic if the color item was not dead center of the photo.</td>', 'I can''t tell if the chicken wire is out of focus or that is motion blur. Would have been better with the wire all solid. I do however like the idea of the color amongst the otherwise grey tones. It would be more dramatic if the color item was not dead center of the photo.', '2006-01-06 12:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009839, 275678, 30841, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2006-01-06 12:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009840, 274900, 30841, '<td valign="top">great photo, crafty title.</td>', 'great photo, crafty title.', '2006-01-06 12:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009845, 274240, 30841, '<td valign="top">I think if there were a sense of an infinite line of cans and also not such a harsh shallow dof the photo would be better 6</td>', 'I think if there were a sense of an infinite line of cans and also not such a harsh shallow dof the photo would be better 6', '2006-01-06 12:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009846, 276100, 47151, '<td valign="top">warm as a foam pad</td>', 'warm as a foam pad', '2006-01-06 12:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009851, 273555, 30841, '<td valign="top">great photo. My only comment is the black fork is a dead on profile while you see more of the white fork, which throws off some of the symmetry. This may be what you intended so I may be wasting my breath.</td>', 'great photo. My only comment is the black fork is a dead on profile while you see more of the white fork, which throws off some of the symmetry. This may be what you intended so I may be wasting my breath.', '2006-01-06 12:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009852, 274057, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like this better with sharper focus.</td>', 'I would like this better with sharper focus.', '2006-01-06 12:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009856, 275707, 30841, '<td valign="top">I love the alltogether sharpness of this photo. Some may complain about the image size, but I believe that is arbitrary. At any rate it is a great photo of a Les Paul. 9</td>', 'I love the alltogether sharpness of this photo. Some may complain about the image size, but I believe that is arbitrary. At any rate it is a great photo of a Les Paul. 9', '2006-01-06 12:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009858, 274005, 47151, '<td valign="top">get a gun and shoot that muther. then move away from that nuke plant</td>', 'get a gun and shoot that muther. then move away from that nuke plant', '2006-01-06 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009861, 276454, 30841, '<td valign="top">one of the best from the challenge. My only comment is the lines are a bit revealing of the model''s clothing. This would have been very effective had the model been nude, but I understand that is always not available. 10</td>', 'one of the best from the challenge. My only comment is the lines are a bit revealing of the model''s clothing. This would have been very effective had the model been nude, but I understand that is always not available. 10', '2006-01-06 12:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009863, 275235, 30841, '<td valign="top">that is odd.</td>', 'that is odd.', '2006-01-06 12:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009867, 276346, 30841, '<td valign="top">The depth of focus is too shallow here</td>', 'The depth of focus is too shallow here', '2006-01-06 12:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009873, 275067, 30841, '<td valign="top">The composition is great and I love the idea of the silhouette. The only issue I have with the silhouette is where the neck meets the body, the curvature picks up some of the light, which compromises the silhouette. Regardless I give it an 8</td>', 'The composition is great and I love the idea of the silhouette. The only issue I have with the silhouette is where the neck meets the body, the curvature picks up some of the light, which compromises the silhouette. Regardless I give it an 8', '2006-01-06 12:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009875, 275312, 30841, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2006-01-06 12:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009876, 276306, 30841, '<td valign="top">unique</td>', 'unique', '2006-01-06 12:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009877, 274841, 30841, '<td valign="top">great model and pose 9</td>', 'great model and pose 9', '2006-01-06 12:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009879, 274009, 30841, '<td valign="top">Simple and perfect. The composition and lighting could not be any better. 10</td>', 'Simple and perfect. The composition and lighting could not be any better. 10', '2006-01-06 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009885, 276038, 30841, '<td valign="top">The photo seems to be taken a bit off center of the bridge. The fence cutoff from the left is lower than the right which takes away from the symmetry I think you were trying to display. Otherwise a solid photo. 7</td>', 'The photo seems to be taken a bit off center of the bridge. The fence cutoff from the left is lower than the right which takes away from the symmetry I think you were trying to display. Otherwise a solid photo. 7', '2006-01-06 12:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009888, 276456, 30841, '<td valign="top">fantastic</td>', 'fantastic', '2006-01-06 12:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009892, 275973, 30841, '<td valign="top">love the title. I also love how there seems to be a solid silver theme to the color. 9</td>', 'love the title. I also love how there seems to be a solid silver theme to the color. 9', '2006-01-06 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009896, 275296, 30841, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the title means, but I really like the composition and the profile image of the rubber ducky.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the title means, but I really like the composition and the profile image of the rubber ducky.', '2006-01-06 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009905, 276477, 30841, '<td valign="top">I think we have a winner. I am almost willing to bump down all of my previous tens so this is the only one. The only criticism I can mention is the blurred image in the lower left corner and the other appearance of something between the 27 1/2cm and 26 1/2cm marks on the lower side of the ruler.</td>', 'I think we have a winner. I am almost willing to bump down all of my previous tens so this is the only one. The only criticism I can mention is the blurred image in the lower left corner and the other appearance of something between the 27 1/2cm and 26 1/2cm marks on the lower side of the ruler.', '2006-01-06 13:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009906, 275408, 30841, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo. 9</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo. 9', '2006-01-06 13:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009907, 273906, 30841, '<td valign="top">what''s with the string?</td>', 'what''s with the string?', '2006-01-06 13:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009913, 276395, 30841, '<td valign="top">great title.</td>', 'great title.', '2006-01-06 13:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
