(2010784, 274584, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice still life, well photgraphed, but not strong on topic. My impressions come more from color and pattern, even the implied action or drama as your title suggests, than from shapes.</td>', 'Nice still life, well photgraphed, but not strong on topic. My impressions come more from color and pattern, even the implied action or drama as your title suggests, than from shapes.', '2006-01-06 18:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
