(2010846, 275804, 50680, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the color and textures.<br/>Only criticism, the lines in the large clam shell on the right make my eyes want to gravitate off away from your focal point and the photo altogether. If this was on the wall next to another interesting photo it might not capture my interest for as long as it should. Where as if the clam shell was turned so the lines ran to the top center I think that as my eyes traveled across your beautiful photo the lines in the shell would lead my eyes back around and naturally bring me back to your focal point. The other spirals keep bringing me back into your little world here leading me to explore more</td>', 'Very nice, love the color and textures.Only criticism, the lines in the large clam shell on the right make my eyes want to gravitate off away from your focal point and the photo altogether. If this was on the wall next to another interesting photo it might not capture my interest for as long as it should. Where as if the clam shell was turned so the lines ran to the top center I think that as my eyes traveled across your beautiful photo the lines in the shell would lead my eyes back around and naturally bring me back to your focal point. The other spirals keep bringing me back into your little world here leading me to explore more', '2006-01-06 18:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
