(2010936, 275114, 20214, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and well done. Looks like you may have a few spots on you camera''s sensor as I see a spot on the cd lower left and also one on HD right of the arm. Not enough to lower the score though. Good job. (8)</td>', 'Nice composition and well done. Looks like you may have a few spots on you camera''s sensor as I see a spot on the cd lower left and also one on HD right of the arm. Not enough to lower the score though. Good job. (8)', '2006-01-06 19:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
