(2010953, 276335, 20214, '<td valign="top">Looks very much like some Japannese (sp?) paintings I''ve seen from time to time. Nice job. (7)</td>', 'Looks very much like some Japannese (sp?) paintings I''ve seen from time to time. Nice job. (7)', '2006-01-06 19:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010955, 275312, 20214, '<td valign="top">Very interesting! Nice use of DOF.</td>', 'Very interesting! Nice use of DOF.', '2006-01-06 19:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010956, 276071, 20214, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and nicely done. I really like it when people use their imagination rather than just throwing something together or snaping the first thing that comes into their viewfinder. I feel that you should at least spend a couple of hours of effort on your entry for the Challenges. That''s not to say that you can''t get lucky and find the perfect shot right from the get go! LOL</td>', 'Clever idea and nicely done. I really like it when people use their imagination rather than just throwing something together or snaping the first thing that comes into their viewfinder. I feel that you should at least spend a couple of hours of effort on your entry for the Challenges. That''s not to say that you can''t get lucky and find the perfect shot right from the get go! LOL', '2006-01-06 19:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010961, 276129, 20214, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2006-01-06 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010962, 275324, 20214, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to seen this photo in B&amp;W, I think it would have had more impact that way, IMHO   (7)</td>', 'I would have liked to seen this photo in B&W, I think it would have had more impact that way, IMHO   (7)', '2006-01-06 19:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010968, 276033, 20214, '<td valign="top">Now he''ll never get across the road, he''s to drunk! LOL Good shot, I like the lighting.</td>', 'Now he''ll never get across the road, he''s to drunk! LOL Good shot, I like the lighting.', '2006-01-06 19:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010984, 274655, 50680, '<td valign="top">Portal to another world. Nice</td>', 'Portal to another world. Nice', '2006-01-06 19:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010995, 276153, 15574, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and crispness.</td>', 'Excellent colors and crispness.', '2006-01-06 19:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011022, 274655, 15574, '<td valign="top">This picture is amazing, reminds me of a dream I had.</td>', 'This picture is amazing, reminds me of a dream I had.', '2006-01-06 19:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011042, 274384, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like the suggestion of the heart shape in the carnations'' arrangement, but the cutout shape seems maybe a bit... dated? to me. Pretty idea, though.</td>', 'I like the suggestion of the heart shape in the carnations'' arrangement, but the cutout shape seems maybe a bit... dated? to me. Pretty idea, though.', '2006-01-06 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011044, 275446, 47487, '<td valign="top">It''s the colors more than the shapes that stand out to me here. The colors ARE great, but I''m not sure how I like the mirror image concept.</td>', 'It''s the colors more than the shapes that stand out to me here. The colors ARE great, but I''m not sure how I like the mirror image concept.', '2006-01-06 20:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011049, 274502, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting object, but perhaps a slightly dull photograph. Nice background, distracting shadow. Good focus and light.</td>', 'This is an interesting object, but perhaps a slightly dull photograph. Nice background, distracting shadow. Good focus and light.', '2006-01-06 20:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011054, 276222, 47487, '<td valign="top">The subject of the photo is pretty, but the lighting is more attention-grabbing than the shape, which is perhaps rather ornate for this challenge, in my opinion.</td>', 'The subject of the photo is pretty, but the lighting is more attention-grabbing than the shape, which is perhaps rather ornate for this challenge, in my opinion.', '2006-01-06 20:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011058, 274363, 47487, '<td valign="top">It''s ideal (but sometimes, um, challenging) to use a challenge to find a reason to take a photo that is worthwhile and compelling on its own merits, not simply because it meets the challenge. Your potholes are interestingly-shaped, but in a year will you look at this photograph and say, ''I''m glad I took that''? I say this in all kindness and humility, because it''s an epiphany I had myself at this site only very recently.</td>', 'It''s ideal (but sometimes, um, challenging) to use a challenge to find a reason to take a photo that is worthwhile and compelling on its own merits, not simply because it meets the challenge. Your potholes are interestingly-shaped, but in a year will you look at this photograph and say, ''I''m glad I took that''? I say this in all kindness and humility, because it''s an epiphany I had myself at this site only very recently.', '2006-01-06 20:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011061, 276403, 50680, '<td valign="top">really nice</td>', 'really nice', '2006-01-06 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011062, 274125, 47487, '<td valign="top">Pretty glow effect to the marbles, but the strip of reflection in each (fluorescent light?) and the noise in the image both detract a bit from it.</td>', 'Pretty glow effect to the marbles, but the strip of reflection in each (fluorescent light?) and the noise in the image both detract a bit from it.', '2006-01-06 20:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011063, 273810, 47487, '<td valign="top">I see several partial shapes but none that stand out. This is a pretty image, but I don''t see the connection to this particular challenge.</td>', 'I see several partial shapes but none that stand out. This is a pretty image, but I don''t see the connection to this particular challenge.', '2006-01-06 20:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011065, 275868, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice -- very pretty. The horizontal line of reflection in the glass is a wee bit distracting. I love the surface fading into the background -- it looks professional.</td>', 'Nice -- very pretty. The horizontal line of reflection in the glass is a wee bit distracting. I love the surface fading into the background -- it looks professional.', '2006-01-06 20:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011068, 275919, 47487, '<td valign="top">I know people are knocking you on the size -- it really is a good idea to use the full 640-pixel dimension if you can, just because people tend to score smaller images lower.<br/> <br/>As for the content of the image, it looks busy, but I can see a focal point, so that''s good. The colors are nice.</td>', 'I know people are knocking you on the size -- it really is a good idea to use the full 640-pixel dimension if you can, just because people tend to score smaller images lower. As for the content of the image, it looks busy, but I can see a focal point, so that''s good. The colors are nice.', '2006-01-06 20:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011075, 273659, 47487, '<td valign="top">Clever! good seeing.</td>', 'Clever! good seeing.', '2006-01-06 20:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2011090, 275208, 45857, '<td valign="top">While technically a good image, I think it is much more involved with the patterns of the art, than the shape.</td>', 'While technically a good image, I think it is much more involved with the patterns of the art, than the shape.', '2006-01-06 20:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
