(2012128, 273817, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s something!  I can''t fault it photographically as its not only a great image, it tells a story too.  Is it a strong shape image?  Perhaps not as much. But I predict a ribbon anyway.</td>', 'Wow, that''s something!  I can''t fault it photographically as its not only a great image, it tells a story too.  Is it a strong shape image?  Perhaps not as much. But I predict a ribbon anyway.', '2006-01-07 06:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
