(2012130, 275929, 42984, '<td valign="top">Yep, lovely, really good colour vs the checkers.  You nailed the composition</td>', 'Yep, lovely, really good colour vs the checkers.  You nailed the composition', '2006-01-07 06:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012131, 275757, 42984, '<td valign="top">Mmmm.  Godo colour, good light, great composition, simple relevant title and meets the challenge :)</td>', 'Mmmm.  Godo colour, good light, great composition, simple relevant title and meets the challenge :)', '2006-01-07 06:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012132, 275393, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love this image.  A couple of things though which may cause your score to disappoint you. 1) The image looks to be tilting right when really the perspective has bitten you.  It probably could benefit from a left rotate in any case. 2) Being a Shape challenge, you have broken up the shape so that it''s not recognisable. Don''t be discouraged though, it''s a great architectural shot.</td>', 'Wow, I love this image.  A couple of things though which may cause your score to disappoint you. 1) The image looks to be tilting right when really the perspective has bitten you.  It probably could benefit from a left rotate in any case. 2) Being a Shape challenge, you have broken up the shape so that it''s not recognisable. Don''t be discouraged though, it''s a great architectural shot.', '2006-01-07 06:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012134, 274593, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice lateral interpretation of the challenge.  Photographically not as strong as your padlock is slightly OOF</td>', 'Nice lateral interpretation of the challenge.  Photographically not as strong as your padlock is slightly OOF', '2006-01-07 06:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
