(2012614, 275145, 35802, '<td valign="top">is there camera shake?  Composition is off to the top left, if going for center.  I like the lighting and definately meets the challenge.</td>', 'is there camera shake?  Composition is off to the top left, if going for center.  I like the lighting and definately meets the challenge.', '2006-01-07 12:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012617, 275983, 35802, '<td valign="top">Good compostion, exposure, and focus, definately meets the challenge.</td>', 'Good compostion, exposure, and focus, definately meets the challenge.', '2006-01-07 12:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012619, 275749, 35802, '<td valign="top">wow.  Love the composition.  Draws attention right away to the multitude of shapes.  One of the best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'wow.  Love the composition.  Draws attention right away to the multitude of shapes.  One of the best I''ve seen so far.', '2006-01-07 12:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012620, 273555, 32966, '<td valign="top">So simple and beautiful.</td>', 'So simple and beautiful.', '2006-01-07 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012623, 274099, 42013, '<td valign="top">color seems just a bit off.  The chocolate doesn''t look dark enough but its been a while since I examined a Toblerone.  Composition looks good.</td>', 'color seems just a bit off.  The chocolate doesn''t look dark enough but its been a while since I examined a Toblerone.  Composition looks good.', '2006-01-07 12:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012627, 276334, 35802, '<td valign="top">Would be perfect if lighting were casting more shadow on the texture of the rock.  Great compostion, great subject. Definately fits the challenge.  Good Job.</td>', 'Would be perfect if lighting were casting more shadow on the texture of the rock.  Great compostion, great subject. Definately fits the challenge.  Good Job.', '2006-01-07 12:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012628, 276226, 35802, '<td valign="top">Lovely compostion, exposure and focus.</td>', 'Lovely compostion, exposure and focus.', '2006-01-07 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012631, 274162, 35802, '<td valign="top">DOF or focus is off, contrast / brightness doesn''t allow cross to pop out of background.</td>', 'DOF or focus is off, contrast / brightness doesn''t allow cross to pop out of background.', '2006-01-07 12:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012634, 275159, 35802, '<td valign="top">The shape of the marbles? or the pillow? It isn''t clear.</td>', 'The shape of the marbles? or the pillow? It isn''t clear.', '2006-01-07 12:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012638, 276449, 35802, '<td valign="top">Great sky. draws you immediately to the flaws in the fence, and where the photo loses sharpness, kinda like a fade out...I like it.</td>', 'Great sky. draws you immediately to the flaws in the fence, and where the photo loses sharpness, kinda like a fade out...I like it.', '2006-01-07 12:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012640, 276403, 35802, '<td valign="top">Interesting transparancy.</td>', 'Interesting transparancy.', '2006-01-07 12:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012647, 275174, 35802, '<td valign="top">I don''t know...very abstract....interesting....hard to judge on photographic level.  Makes me wonder if it is a photo, or just an image created in ps.</td>', 'I don''t know...very abstract....interesting....hard to judge on photographic level.  Makes me wonder if it is a photo, or just an image created in ps.', '2006-01-07 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012648, 276311, 35802, '<td valign="top">Great compostion, love the color and lighting.</td>', 'Great compostion, love the color and lighting.', '2006-01-07 12:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012650, 274584, 35802, '<td valign="top">Yummy, reminds me of my grandma!</td>', 'Yummy, reminds me of my grandma!', '2006-01-07 12:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012653, 273446, 35802, '<td valign="top">Focus doesn''t seem to be as sharp as it could be, perhaps better lighting required.  I love the concept and the shapes.</td>', 'Focus doesn''t seem to be as sharp as it could be, perhaps better lighting required.  I love the concept and the shapes.', '2006-01-07 12:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012655, 275252, 35802, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Compostion leaves the photo to seem as though its cut in half.</td>', 'Cute.  Compostion leaves the photo to seem as though its cut in half.', '2006-01-07 12:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012657, 274058, 35802, '<td valign="top">OOF, Compostion almost there. Love the subject!</td>', 'OOF, Compostion almost there. Love the subject!', '2006-01-07 12:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012659, 276456, 42013, '<td valign="top">It seems as if "La Mer" could also be titled "el Pacifico" :)  Would this tree make its appearance again in 06?<br/> <br/>That aside, the shape of the tree works good and I like the people at the bottom for scale.</td>', 'It seems as if "La Mer" could also be titled "el Pacifico" :)  Would this tree make its appearance again in 06? That aside, the shape of the tree works good and I like the people at the bottom for scale.', '2006-01-07 12:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012663, 276459, 35802, '<td valign="top">I love how you lose the other objects to overexposure ie. the container cap, but the pills almost come to life they are so vivid.  Good job.</td>', 'I love how you lose the other objects to overexposure ie. the container cap, but the pills almost come to life they are so vivid.  Good job.', '2006-01-07 12:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012666, 273572, 35802, '<td valign="top">disturbing, what is it? Intriguing.</td>', 'disturbing, what is it? Intriguing.', '2006-01-07 12:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012668, 274576, 35802, '<td valign="top">good focus and dof and composition.</td>', 'good focus and dof and composition.', '2006-01-07 12:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012670, 273899, 42013, '<td valign="top">nice angle, a little different look at a often used subject.</td>', 'nice angle, a little different look at a often used subject.', '2006-01-07 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012672, 276222, 35802, '<td valign="top">greater dof required to keep steeple in focus, perhaps longer exposure and white balance to bring out the colors and light on the church.  Nice shape.</td>', 'greater dof required to keep steeple in focus, perhaps longer exposure and white balance to bring out the colors and light on the church.  Nice shape.', '2006-01-07 12:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012675, 276273, 42013, '<td valign="top">Is the pepperoni real???</td>', 'Is the pepperoni real???', '2006-01-07 12:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012678, 276016, 35802, '<td valign="top">Light overblown in contrast, more shadow would be more appealing to me...Beautiful shape however.</td>', 'Light overblown in contrast, more shadow would be more appealing to me...Beautiful shape however.', '2006-01-07 12:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012681, 274631, 35802, '<td valign="top">Love the compostion.  Simple and to the point.  Awesome.</td>', 'Love the compostion.  Simple and to the point.  Awesome.', '2006-01-07 12:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012690, 275067, 35802, '<td valign="top">Background is distracting with the spots on the left side.  and the light at the neck of guitar.  Great subject however.</td>', 'Background is distracting with the spots on the left side.  and the light at the neck of guitar.  Great subject however.', '2006-01-07 12:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012693, 276478, 35802, '<td valign="top">The shape of winter. I like it.  Love the snowing in the background, icicles could benefit from greater light source to really glow.  Nice.</td>', 'The shape of winter. I like it.  Love the snowing in the background, icicles could benefit from greater light source to really glow.  Nice.', '2006-01-07 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012695, 275118, 35802, '<td valign="top">Great title, sounds like Simon and Garfunkle!  Beautiful natural shape. Good compostion.</td>', 'Great title, sounds like Simon and Garfunkle!  Beautiful natural shape. Good compostion.', '2006-01-07 12:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012699, 276037, 35802, '<td valign="top">nice capture.</td>', 'nice capture.', '2006-01-07 12:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012700, 274359, 35802, '<td valign="top">distracting blurr in top right corner, really takes away from the photo, to bad its basic editing.  The drop is good.</td>', 'distracting blurr in top right corner, really takes away from the photo, to bad its basic editing.  The drop is good.', '2006-01-07 12:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012702, 275649, 35802, '<td valign="top">Would be nice to see a bigger version to make out the detail.  Love the color, love the shape, but the shelving in the backround is distracting from the wheel.</td>', 'Would be nice to see a bigger version to make out the detail.  Love the color, love the shape, but the shelving in the backround is distracting from the wheel.', '2006-01-07 12:48:52.000000', NULL, 1);
