(2012703, 275201, 35802, '<td valign="top">Flesh is very yellow, love the concept, might stand out more in b &amp; w.  DOF or focus kind of throws it off a little.  Nice title.</td>', 'Flesh is very yellow, love the concept, might stand out more in b & w.  DOF or focus kind of throws it off a little.  Nice title.', '2006-01-07 12:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
