(2012718, 275206, 35802, '<td valign="top">Makes it hard to vote because its a great photo, but I try and vote along the lines of meeting the challenge as well, and shapes aren''t really what stands out in this photograph.  Well done, and intriguing photo.</td>', 'Makes it hard to vote because its a great photo, but I try and vote along the lines of meeting the challenge as well, and shapes aren''t really what stands out in this photograph.  Well done, and intriguing photo.', '2006-01-07 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012723, 275641, 35802, '<td valign="top">The subject of shapes doesn''t stank out to me in this photo, in fact the "sphere is lost in the sand or snow.  I understand the play on words and still just doesn''t make it for me.</td>', 'The subject of shapes doesn''t stank out to me in this photo, in fact the "sphere is lost in the sand or snow.  I understand the play on words and still just doesn''t make it for me.', '2006-01-07 12:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
