(2013931, 276046, 43329, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a shapes challenge, but the image is too small to be viewed adequately, and you lose impact because of it. <br/>You can post images up to 640 pixels on the larger dimension.</td>', 'Nice idea for a shapes challenge, but the image is too small to be viewed adequately, and you lose impact because of it. You can post images up to 640 pixels on the larger dimension.', '2006-01-07 22:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2013932, 275451, 43329, '<td valign="top">With the lettering and the star, the cattle head and the maps of Texas, it''s hard to pick out which is the shape to concentrate on. Also, the image is smaller than it needs to be - up to 640 pixels on the larger dimension is allowed.</td>', 'With the lettering and the star, the cattle head and the maps of Texas, it''s hard to pick out which is the shape to concentrate on. Also, the image is smaller than it needs to be - up to 640 pixels on the larger dimension is allowed.', '2006-01-07 22:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2013933, 274151, 43329, '<td valign="top">There''s a problem here with camera shake. <br/>Perhaps you could use a shorter exposure time, or a tripod.<br/>A remote shutter-release controller will avoid camera movement during the exposure, too.</td>', 'There''s a problem here with camera shake. Perhaps you could use a shorter exposure time, or a tripod.A remote shutter-release controller will avoid camera movement during the exposure, too.', '2006-01-07 22:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2013934, 275919, 43329, '<td valign="top">These are great holiday candies! <br/>But the concept of shape is overwhelmed by all the colours and all the textures of the wrappers. Perhaps if you had isolated the one in the purple wrapper against a plain background, the shape of the object would be stronger.<br/>Also, the image is so small that it''s hard to see the details... you can post images up to 640 pixels on the larger dimension.</td>', 'These are great holiday candies! But the concept of shape is overwhelmed by all the colours and all the textures of the wrappers. Perhaps if you had isolated the one in the purple wrapper against a plain background, the shape of the object would be stronger.Also, the image is so small that it''s hard to see the details... you can post images up to 640 pixels on the larger dimension.', '2006-01-07 22:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2013935, 273572, 43329, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but your depth of field is so narrow that only a fraction of the image is in focus. Try shooting with a smaller aperture (larger number f-stop) to widen the focal range.</td>', 'Sorry, but your depth of field is so narrow that only a fraction of the image is in focus. Try shooting with a smaller aperture (larger number f-stop) to widen the focal range.', '2006-01-07 22:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2013936, 274356, 43329, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this image is out of focus. The point of focus appears to be in the branches several inches behind the ornament.<br/>The photo is also over-enlarged and pixelated. <br/>Nice idea, but you need check the image before you post it.</td>', 'Sorry, but this image is out of focus. The point of focus appears to be in the branches several inches behind the ornament.The photo is also over-enlarged and pixelated. Nice idea, but you need check the image before you post it.', '2006-01-07 22:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2013943, 276401, 43329, '<td valign="top">Sorry for scoring this so low, because it is a great interpretation of the challenge, and it has nice focus and composition. <br/>But the image is so small that the detail and overall impact in the photo is lost. <br/>You can submit images up to 640 pixels on the larger dimension.</td>', 'Sorry for scoring this so low, because it is a great interpretation of the challenge, and it has nice focus and composition. But the image is so small that the detail and overall impact in the photo is lost. You can submit images up to 640 pixels on the larger dimension.', '2006-01-07 23:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2013945, 274426, 43329, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and interesting interpretation of the challenge. Unfortunately, most of the image is out of focus. Try shooting with a smaller aperture (f16 or f22) to get a greater depth of field to get more of the object in focus.<br/> <br/>*edited to correct error*<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-12 06:58:32.</i></td>', 'Nice angle and interesting interpretation of the challenge. Unfortunately, most of the image is out of focus. Try shooting with a smaller aperture (f16 or f22) to get a greater depth of field to get more of the object in focus. *edited to correct error*', '2006-01-07 23:05:09.000000', '2006-01-12 06:58:32.000000', 1),
(2013946, 274113, 43329, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but the idea of shape is lost because most of the objects are out of focus. Try shooting with a narrower aperture (larger f-stop number) to get a wider depth of field and more of the objects in focus. This will enhance the idea of comparing shapes</td>', 'Interesting shot, but the idea of shape is lost because most of the objects are out of focus. Try shooting with a narrower aperture (larger f-stop number) to get a wider depth of field and more of the objects in focus. This will enhance the idea of comparing shapes', '2006-01-07 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2013959, 275310, 43329, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but there are just too many distractions in this photo. <br/> <br/>The cropping around the main shape is very tight; the photo would benefit from some plain background space. <br/>The floral pattern on the box takes away from the heart shape. <br/>The object in the upper right corner draws the eye away from the central object. <br/>The tag coming out of the box breaks up the echoing heart-shaped shadow from the box bottom.<br/>And, the verbal message contradicts the visual message in a very distracting way. <br/>If the visual distractions were removed, perhaps this could be an interesting "mixed message" photo... but as it is, the photo doesn''t say "shape" to me.</td>', 'Sorry, but there are just too many distractions in this photo.  The cropping around the main shape is very tight; the photo would benefit from some plain background space. The floral pattern on the box takes away from the heart shape. The object in the upper right corner draws the eye away from the central object. The tag coming out of the box breaks up the echoing heart-shaped shadow from the box bottom.And, the verbal message contradicts the visual message in a very distracting way. If the visual distractions were removed, perhaps this could be an interesting "mixed message" photo... but as it is, the photo doesn''t say "shape" to me.', '2006-01-07 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
