(2014468, 275632, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Excellent colors.  The color reflection on the water/bokeh is very nice and complements the bird and the composition well.  The shadow play/placement is also very good.  Criticism; difficult, especially to <i>not</i> contradict anything I''ve just said.  A few small blown areas on the white feathers, but difficult to control and fairly minor.  Perhaps a little more detail in the back of the head and the neck and maybe, not sure, ''wider'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  As for meeting the Challenge, there''s a definite shape(s) there, it''s just not the <i>"most important aspect"</i> of the photograph, in my opinion, therefore can''t quite take it higher than 8.  Maybe a crop variation may have enhanced the ''shape'', especially the ''curve'', who knows.  Taking the liberty of adding to my favorites.  Very nice shot.</td>', '8 - Excellent colors.  The color reflection on the water/bokeh is very nice and complements the bird and the composition well.  The shadow play/placement is also very good.  Criticism; difficult, especially to not contradict anything I''ve just said.  A few small blown areas on the white feathers, but difficult to control and fairly minor.  Perhaps a little more detail in the back of the head and the neck and maybe, not sure, ''wider'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  As for meeting the Challenge, there''s a definite shape(s) there, it''s just not the "most important aspect" of the photograph, in my opinion, therefore can''t quite take it higher than 8.  Maybe a crop variation may have enhanced the ''shape'', especially the ''curve'', who knows.  Taking the liberty of adding to my favorites.  Very nice shot.', '2006-01-08 06:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014470, 276392, 28097, '<td valign="top">very nice... good job.. i like the glow in a dimmed surrounding</td>', 'very nice... good job.. i like the glow in a dimmed surrounding', '2006-01-08 06:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014480, 274333, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Interesting natural shapes.  Nice simple coloring.  Criticism; very difficult, but even sharper, more defined on the icicles and their ''glassiness'', would have made this even better in my opinion.  The patterns within them look interesting too, but hard to discern/appreciate at this size of course.  I like the composition/crop, perhaps a fraction more space on the right would have given this a little more overall balance, but minor.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Interesting natural shapes.  Nice simple coloring.  Criticism; very difficult, but even sharper, more defined on the icicles and their ''glassiness'', would have made this even better in my opinion.  The patterns within them look interesting too, but hard to discern/appreciate at this size of course.  I like the composition/crop, perhaps a fraction more space on the right would have given this a little more overall balance, but minor.', '2006-01-08 06:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014487, 274724, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  The DOF is near perfect showing the ''tail''/tip just starting to disappear.  Coloring is good, especially the greens.  Good ''hair''/texture capture and the lighting is nice.  Criticism; mainly just the blown areas at the top of the ''curl'' on the flower petals, but difficult to control I imagine, especially as you seem to have retained good detail in the darker areas.  Not sure on the frame, ''works'', but at this size, perhaps a touch too thick in my opinion, but just a preference thing.  Up to 8 from 7.  Taking the liberty of adding to Favorites.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  The DOF is near perfect showing the ''tail''/tip just starting to disappear.  Coloring is good, especially the greens.  Good ''hair''/texture capture and the lighting is nice.  Criticism; mainly just the blown areas at the top of the ''curl'' on the flower petals, but difficult to control I imagine, especially as you seem to have retained good detail in the darker areas.  Not sure on the frame, ''works'', but at this size, perhaps a touch too thick in my opinion, but just a preference thing.  Up to 8 from 7.  Taking the liberty of adding to Favorites.', '2006-01-08 06:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014492, 276071, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice colors.  Good shapes.  Criticism; slightly grainy (or could be resizing issues or gamma, not sure), especially at the top, which detracts overall, in my opinion.  Difficult shot, and difficult to do, but even sharper/more defined, making the bubbles/shapes ''pop'' more, and the colors a fraction too, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice colors.  Good shapes.  Criticism; slightly grainy (or could be resizing issues or gamma, not sure), especially at the top, which detracts overall, in my opinion.  Difficult shot, and difficult to do, but even sharper/more defined, making the bubbles/shapes ''pop'' more, and the colors a fraction too, make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-01-08 06:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014495, 275406, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Nice simple coloring.  Good two-for-one shape capture.  Criticism; mainly the overall ''darkness''.  Your call obviously and, depending what you had to work with, but an inclusion of more of the light/sun on the left (difficult likely) and possibly a tighter crop at the bottom (especially to try to exclude that green/brown ''something'' bottom right) and more included at the top (again depending what you had) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Difficult shot, but if it, the web or the droplets/spheres/circles, were even sharper, also likely would have ''lifted'' this a little more.  Whether intentional or not, I like the way you lined up the center of the web against the darker part of the background to help lift it.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Nice simple coloring.  Good two-for-one shape capture.  Criticism; mainly the overall ''darkness''.  Your call obviously and, depending what you had to work with, but an inclusion of more of the light/sun on the left (difficult likely) and possibly a tighter crop at the bottom (especially to try to exclude that green/brown ''something'' bottom right) and more included at the top (again depending what you had) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Difficult shot, but if it, the web or the droplets/spheres/circles, were even sharper, also likely would have ''lifted'' this a little more.  Whether intentional or not, I like the way you lined up the center of the web against the darker part of the background to help lift it.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-08 06:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
