(2015202, 274720, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like your frame, DOF is good, Something about the placement of the shell is off to me, but i''m not sure what.  Possibly it would look more complete if the shell was cropped slightly at the bottom.  I think our eyes are used to seeing a base either real or implied under an object.  JMO.</td>', 'I like your frame, DOF is good, Something about the placement of the shell is off to me, but i''m not sure what.  Possibly it would look more complete if the shell was cropped slightly at the bottom.  I think our eyes are used to seeing a base either real or implied under an object.  JMO.', '2006-01-08 15:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015212, 275014, 33947, '<td valign="top">Ah, a spider web person after my own heart. Nice job!! Great focus all around and nice light.</td>', 'Ah, a spider web person after my own heart. Nice job!! Great focus all around and nice light.', '2006-01-08 15:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
