(2015439, 274841, 18080, '<td valign="top">LOL<br/>Just comented on the ''mother'' challenge and then went to shapes and this was the first one that opened up. Pretty sure it''s from the same shoot.<br/>best of luck in both challenges.<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'LOLJust comented on the ''mother'' challenge and then went to shapes and this was the first one that opened up. Pretty sure it''s from the same shoot.best of luck in both challenges. Kev', '2006-01-08 17:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015462, 276128, 48876, '<td valign="top">Wow,I really love this one!Great job!</td>', 'Wow,I really love this one!Great job!', '2006-01-08 17:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015475, 276456, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hey, I''ve seen this before. :)  Nice capture.  I like your choice of vertical composition.  Is this you Zoomdak?  Finally getting around to voting. 9</td>', 'Hey, I''ve seen this before. :)  Nice capture.  I like your choice of vertical composition.  Is this you Zoomdak?  Finally getting around to voting. 9', '2006-01-08 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015492, 274359, 48876, '<td valign="top">I think it just needs to be cropped a little,whatever is in the top right corner is a little distracting.The water drop is beautiful!</td>', 'I think it just needs to be cropped a little,whatever is in the top right corner is a little distracting.The water drop is beautiful!', '2006-01-08 17:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015495, 275649, 40718, '<td valign="top">try to use all 640 pixels next time.  People tend to vote the small pictures lower.  Search for threads and you''ll find how to do it.</td>', 'try to use all 640 pixels next time.  People tend to vote the small pictures lower.  Search for threads and you''ll find how to do it.', '2006-01-08 17:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015521, 275989, 47987, '<td valign="top">NICE PHOTO<br/>The natural shapes are the best.</td>', 'NICE PHOTOThe natural shapes are the best.', '2006-01-08 17:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015532, 275929, 23962, '<td valign="top">Choose a ribbon.</td>', 'Choose a ribbon.', '2006-01-08 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015534, 274724, 42984, '<td valign="top">This really does work well and it is the complimentary OOF background that is so uplifting to it</td>', 'This really does work well and it is the complimentary OOF background that is so uplifting to it', '2006-01-08 18:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015537, 275989, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wow, that tree''s had a hard life!  If you''d managed to get the background even more out of focus, it would have helped the impact of the main interest even more</td>', 'Wow, that tree''s had a hard life!  If you''d managed to get the background even more out of focus, it would have helped the impact of the main interest even more', '2006-01-08 18:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015538, 275191, 42984, '<td valign="top">Bet you''d wished you''d know abotu Burst of Colour :)</td>', 'Bet you''d wished you''d know abotu Burst of Colour :)', '2006-01-08 18:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015540, 276233, 42984, '<td valign="top">It almost has a fine art painting quality to it ... interesting.  I think you''l probably already have a lot of fcus comments</td>', 'It almost has a fine art painting quality to it ... interesting.  I think you''l probably already have a lot of fcus comments', '2006-01-08 18:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015542, 275067, 42984, '<td valign="top">I love the way its in total silhouette .. all except for the neck gusset</td>', 'I love the way its in total silhouette .. all except for the neck gusset', '2006-01-08 18:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015543, 274356, 43088, '<td valign="top">Sorry but focus is a major problem with this one. I am sure you already have several comments about this though.</td>', 'Sorry but focus is a major problem with this one. I am sure you already have several comments about this though.', '2006-01-08 18:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015546, 274904, 43088, '<td valign="top">Great idea and excellent composition and lighting but I would like to see more depth of field- using a higher f stop numbet to gst more detail in the ahell. The focus seems to be on the background.</td>', 'Great idea and excellent composition and lighting but I would like to see more depth of field- using a higher f stop numbet to gst more detail in the ahell. The focus seems to be on the background.', '2006-01-08 18:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015550, 275707, 42984, '<td valign="top">Well lit and composed, the hit of back light is just right</td>', 'Well lit and composed, the hit of back light is just right', '2006-01-08 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015551, 275290, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but I think the border distracts and it may have been a little nicer to show a little more of the leaf. Excellent lighting and composition.</td>', 'Very nice, but I think the border distracts and it may have been a little nicer to show a little more of the leaf. Excellent lighting and composition.', '2006-01-08 18:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015553, 273899, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very tasteful.  I like the subdued light and the soft tones on the wood. Good job</td>', 'Very tasteful.  I like the subdued light and the soft tones on the wood. Good job', '2006-01-08 18:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015555, 274255, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice composition splitting the frame down the middle</td>', 'Nice composition splitting the frame down the middle', '2006-01-08 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015559, 276284, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good halftones.  Holding all the detaail is such a white environment is hard work</td>', 'Good halftones.  Holding all the detaail is such a white environment is hard work', '2006-01-08 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015564, 276046, 42984, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the B&amp;W since the underside of CD''s are so colourful</td>', 'Not sure about the B&W since the underside of CD''s are so colourful', '2006-01-08 18:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015567, 275201, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cool coulours, ice subdued light</td>', 'Cool coulours, ice subdued light', '2006-01-08 18:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015569, 275642, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very good. I was wondering how this would look if it were a little wider to the left- leaving a more obvious hole in the image where the fallen tree would have been. Excellent exposure. 7.</td>', 'Very good. I was wondering how this would look if it were a little wider to the left- leaving a more obvious hole in the image where the fallen tree would have been. Excellent exposure. 7.', '2006-01-08 18:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015570, 275527, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Great lighting treatment and cropping</td>', 'Cool.  Great lighting treatment and cropping', '2006-01-08 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015575, 275642, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love the title and the imagery but probably not a strong Shape entry - which is a pity</td>', 'Love the title and the imagery but probably not a strong Shape entry - which is a pity', '2006-01-08 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015578, 273825, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!</td>', 'Very cool shot!', '2006-01-08 18:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015580, 276387, 42984, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the shape and the colouration.  It''s a pity that you had to force it post processing ans it has ended up looking too grainy. This had high score written all over it until I saw the grain</td>', 'I LOVE the shape and the colouration.  It''s a pity that you had to force it post processing ans it has ended up looking too grainy. This had high score written all over it until I saw the grain', '2006-01-08 18:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015585, 274151, 42984, '<td valign="top">The problem with mirrors is that you get two reflective surfaces being the surface of the glass and then the silvering which is on the back.  That''s cost you here which is a shame. Also the camera shake hasn''t made it any kinder</td>', 'The problem with mirrors is that you get two reflective surfaces being the surface of the glass and then the silvering which is on the back.  That''s cost you here which is a shame. Also the camera shake hasn''t made it any kinder', '2006-01-08 18:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
