(2015796, 276089, 35802, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  I love the decor too! the heart is perfect! Great exposure, The lady on the right is a little distracting however.</td>', 'I love this photo.  I love the decor too! the heart is perfect! Great exposure, The lady on the right is a little distracting however.', '2006-01-08 19:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
