(2015876, 274724, 16046, '<td valign="top">interesting plant, must be from "down under", well shot, good luck</td>', 'interesting plant, must be from "down under", well shot, good luck', '2006-01-08 20:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015886, 274179, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good choice of color, good luck</td>', 'Very nice, good choice of color, good luck', '2006-01-08 20:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015902, 273917, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot! The colors, contrast, composition are all virtually perfect. There are a few post processing artifacts but none so severe that they would bother me much. The degree of difficulty of this shot, plus it''s excellence make it a top entry in my book.</td>', 'Lovely shot! The colors, contrast, composition are all virtually perfect. There are a few post processing artifacts but none so severe that they would bother me much. The degree of difficulty of this shot, plus it''s excellence make it a top entry in my book.', '2006-01-08 20:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015906, 276470, 18197, '<td valign="top">Phenominal shot. I wish I could have been standing there with you when you took it. I can almost smell the cold. Thanks you for what I hope will be a ribbon entry.</td>', 'Phenominal shot. I wish I could have been standing there with you when you took it. I can almost smell the cold. Thanks you for what I hope will be a ribbon entry.', '2006-01-08 20:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015910, 276168, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very techno- shot. I like your rotation, big improvement over landscape. Conversion to B&amp;W is superb. Levels of gray are terrific. Composition is wonderful. "You done good!"</td>', 'Very techno- shot. I like your rotation, big improvement over landscape. Conversion to B&W is superb. Levels of gray are terrific. Composition is wonderful. "You done good!"', '2006-01-08 20:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015915, 275442, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like how you made this simple object interesting with dynamic lighting</td>', 'I like how you made this simple object interesting with dynamic lighting', '2006-01-08 20:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015916, 274720, 18197, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the DOF and the detail you have preserved here. Possibly the strongest entry in the challenge in terms of meeting the challenge. Subtle colors strengthen the image. Great job. Among my top picks.</td>', 'I absolutely love the DOF and the detail you have preserved here. Possibly the strongest entry in the challenge in terms of meeting the challenge. Subtle colors strengthen the image. Great job. Among my top picks.', '2006-01-08 20:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015919, 275929, 18197, '<td valign="top">Looking at the thumbnail, I did not expect to like this. When I opened it, it was such a pleasant surprise. Well composed. Well executed. Well presented. Well processed. And I love the title (I''m a bit of a science geek and the reference to Galileo really appeals to me.)</td>', 'Looking at the thumbnail, I did not expect to like this. When I opened it, it was such a pleasant surprise. Well composed. Well executed. Well presented. Well processed. And I love the title (I''m a bit of a science geek and the reference to Galileo really appeals to me.)', '2006-01-08 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015920, 274333, 18197, '<td valign="top">This photo better than any in the challenge uses foreground/background to define an interesting shape. It is really a very powerful and interesting image.</td>', 'This photo better than any in the challenge uses foreground/background to define an interesting shape. It is really a very powerful and interesting image.', '2006-01-08 20:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015922, 274973, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not to trivialize your photo, but I really like the slack lines and the curves they make. There may be lots of other nice aspects, but you''ve captured the lines superbly!</td>', 'Not to trivialize your photo, but I really like the slack lines and the curves they make. There may be lots of other nice aspects, but you''ve captured the lines superbly!', '2006-01-08 20:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015928, 275182, 18197, '<td valign="top">Rotating your image was a superb post processing decision. You have taken a good image and fit it to the challenge so much better this way because it emphasizes the shape, and creates interest trying to figure out what I''m looking at. Very well done!</td>', 'Rotating your image was a superb post processing decision. You have taken a good image and fit it to the challenge so much better this way because it emphasizes the shape, and creates interest trying to figure out what I''m looking at. Very well done!', '2006-01-08 20:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015930, 275929, 31005, '<td valign="top">very cool idea, great color and DOF.</td>', 'very cool idea, great color and DOF.', '2006-01-08 20:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015931, 274116, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellent image and a terrific fit with the challenge theme. I like the composition very much as well as the colors and DOF. Hope it does well in the voting!</td>', 'Excellent image and a terrific fit with the challenge theme. I like the composition very much as well as the colors and DOF. Hope it does well in the voting!', '2006-01-08 20:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015937, 273915, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not an especially new idea but very well executed. You have done a nice job capturing a wide spectrum of light levels. The shape is intrinsiclly interesting. The shadows, while subtle enhance the overall image. Lighting is subtly effective. Great job!</td>', 'Not an especially new idea but very well executed. You have done a nice job capturing a wide spectrum of light levels. The shape is intrinsiclly interesting. The shadows, while subtle enhance the overall image. Lighting is subtly effective. Great job!', '2006-01-08 20:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015938, 276071, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea well executed. Congratulations on this capture and subsequent post processing.</td>', 'Fantastic idea well executed. Congratulations on this capture and subsequent post processing.', '2006-01-08 20:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015940, 274179, 18197, '<td valign="top">Based on the thumb, I expected this to be a ho-hum-been-there-and-done-that image. What a pleasant surprise. Colors and contrast help distinguyish it from the genre. Nice crop with thoughtful foreground/background shapes. Great fit for the challenge theme. Very well done. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Based on the thumb, I expected this to be a ho-hum-been-there-and-done-that image. What a pleasant surprise. Colors and contrast help distinguyish it from the genre. Nice crop with thoughtful foreground/background shapes. Great fit for the challenge theme. Very well done. Among my top picks.', '2006-01-08 20:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015944, 274215, 18197, '<td valign="top">Composition is okay but desaturating the image didn''t help in this instance. For this to score highly in my estimation, I would want to see anatomically correct texture in all the fruit (i.e. knock my socks with great texture!), which implies greater DOF, very precise focus plus somewhat different lighting. These are my preferences and you may disagree.</td>', 'Composition is okay but desaturating the image didn''t help in this instance. For this to score highly in my estimation, I would want to see anatomically correct texture in all the fruit (i.e. knock my socks with great texture!), which implies greater DOF, very precise focus plus somewhat different lighting. These are my preferences and you may disagree.', '2006-01-08 20:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015948, 275919, 18197, '<td valign="top">"Shape" gets lost in the busy-ness of the subject for me. Decent image. Make it bigger next time ... use all 640 pixels available to you. PM me if you want to discuss size.</td>', '"Shape" gets lost in the busy-ness of the subject for me. Decent image. Make it bigger next time ... use all 640 pixels available to you. PM me if you want to discuss size.', '2006-01-08 20:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015953, 274724, 47852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, great use of dof, and a unique shape.  One of my favorites... well done!</td>', 'Beautiful colors, great use of dof, and a unique shape.  One of my favorites... well done!', '2006-01-08 20:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015963, 273825, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great subject for this challenge!  A tad bright in the center, but I love the tones and lines of this shot.  Well done!</td>', 'Great subject for this challenge!  A tad bright in the center, but I love the tones and lines of this shot.  Well done!', '2006-01-08 20:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015966, 273576, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity of this shot.  The colors are a bit dull for me, but still a great shot.</td>', 'Love the simplicity of this shot.  The colors are a bit dull for me, but still a great shot.', '2006-01-08 20:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2016060, 275973, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful line...light, too.</td>', 'Beautiful line...light, too.', '2006-01-08 21:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2016077, 274854, 33947, '<td valign="top">Superb placement and line. Very professional. Love it. Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Superb placement and line. Very professional. Love it. Hope it does well for you.', '2006-01-08 21:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2016181, 275312, 39184, '<td valign="top">This one definitely stands out from the crowd!</td>', 'This one definitely stands out from the crowd!', '2006-01-08 21:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
