(2016509, 275088, 31403, '<td valign="top">the black space really takes the energy out of this for me.  I would love to see interesting tight crops witht the shapes and the reflections playing a larger role - 5</td>', 'the black space really takes the energy out of this for me.  I would love to see interesting tight crops witht the shapes and the reflections playing a larger role - 5', '2006-01-08 23:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
