(2021290, 273917, 42171, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.<br/> <br/>Can''t help think it would have been better if you had caught the birds eye instead of it being hidden. Still a fantastic effort!</td>', 'Excellent shot. Can''t help think it would have been better if you had caught the birds eye instead of it being hidden. Still a fantastic effort!', '2006-01-10 06:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021458, 275406, 50695, '<td valign="top">the wet spiderweb motif is not terribly original, but it fulfills the challenge well, with the shapes of the drops and the more rectangular shapes of negative space within the web. Also, a well-executed shot.</td>', 'the wet spiderweb motif is not terribly original, but it fulfills the challenge well, with the shapes of the drops and the more rectangular shapes of negative space within the web. Also, a well-executed shot.', '2006-01-10 08:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021459, 276311, 50695, '<td valign="top">this does have a separate existence as shapes on a flat plane, I just wish the illusion were more powerful, and I didn''t keep remembering that this is just a camera pointing up. It''s close though. Maybe if the shadows were different or the contrast were higher... I''m not sure.</td>', 'this does have a separate existence as shapes on a flat plane, I just wish the illusion were more powerful, and I didn''t keep remembering that this is just a camera pointing up. It''s close though. Maybe if the shadows were different or the contrast were higher... I''m not sure.', '2006-01-10 08:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021463, 273720, 50695, '<td valign="top">The bars and the shadows make rectangles, which fulfills the challenge. But I wish I could see those rectangles more "clearly"... cleanly?</td>', 'The bars and the shadows make rectangles, which fulfills the challenge. But I wish I could see those rectangles more "clearly"... cleanly?', '2006-01-10 08:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021465, 275210, 50695, '<td valign="top">this could fulfill the challenge in one of two ways: the shapes of the face''s contour around the eye, or the implied shape of the eyeball. The narrow depth of field works against both of those scenarios, though it creates its own interesting effects.</td>', 'this could fulfill the challenge in one of two ways: the shapes of the face''s contour around the eye, or the implied shape of the eyeball. The narrow depth of field works against both of those scenarios, though it creates its own interesting effects.', '2006-01-10 08:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021466, 275923, 50695, '<td valign="top">aren''t cross sections fascinating? enjoyed.</td>', 'aren''t cross sections fascinating? enjoyed.', '2006-01-10 08:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021468, 273744, 50695, '<td valign="top">I see a dog and an upside-down crocodile!</td>', 'I see a dog and an upside-down crocodile!', '2006-01-10 08:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021469, 275118, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition and color</td>', 'beautiful composition and color', '2006-01-10 08:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021471, 276226, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think I''m a minority opinion around here, but for me when there is no background I feel like I''m only getting half the picture.</td>', 'I think I''m a minority opinion around here, but for me when there is no background I feel like I''m only getting half the picture.', '2006-01-10 08:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021472, 276433, 50695, '<td valign="top">in chess, shape = function. nicely done.</td>', 'in chess, shape = function. nicely done.', '2006-01-10 08:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021473, 276477, 50695, '<td valign="top">the surreal balance/imbalance of this reminds me of Man Ray.</td>', 'the surreal balance/imbalance of this reminds me of Man Ray.', '2006-01-10 08:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021474, 275235, 50695, '<td valign="top">a simple trick but very effective. kudos.</td>', 'a simple trick but very effective. kudos.', '2006-01-10 08:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021475, 275369, 50695, '<td valign="top">I wonder if there is a more interesting contrast than black and white?</td>', 'I wonder if there is a more interesting contrast than black and white?', '2006-01-10 08:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021478, 276071, 50695, '<td valign="top">cool! even better: funky.</td>', 'cool! even better: funky.', '2006-01-10 08:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021480, 274162, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love cathedrals and how the shape of the cross is somehow integrated into the architecture itself. You''ve captured that well.</td>', 'I love cathedrals and how the shape of the cross is somehow integrated into the architecture itself. You''ve captured that well.', '2006-01-10 08:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021481, 275152, 50695, '<td valign="top">I know I''m just a cynical adult, but it looks more like a vapor trail disintegrating.</td>', 'I know I''m just a cynical adult, but it looks more like a vapor trail disintegrating.', '2006-01-10 08:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021484, 273659, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the poignancy of a fallen tree and the heady symbolism of snow and ice take precedent over shape.</td>', 'I''m afraid the poignancy of a fallen tree and the heady symbolism of snow and ice take precedent over shape.', '2006-01-10 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021489, 273528, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''d be more interested to see what this would look like with a real lens in the glasses. If there is a lens in there, you should''ve pulled out a little more so that I could get a sense of the distortion.</td>', 'I''d be more interested to see what this would look like with a real lens in the glasses. If there is a lens in there, you should''ve pulled out a little more so that I could get a sense of the distortion.', '2006-01-10 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021491, 273696, 50695, '<td valign="top">I would''ve preferred the lampshade to be square as well. But good otherwise.</td>', 'I would''ve preferred the lampshade to be square as well. But good otherwise.', '2006-01-10 08:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021492, 275145, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like that this looks like it was taken on the street. That fits your title theme and just makes for a more interesting visual.</td>', 'I like that this looks like it was taken on the street. That fits your title theme and just makes for a more interesting visual.', '2006-01-10 08:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021495, 274834, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love windows, but there are so many other shapes here as well, caused by the discolorations in the wall and the negative space in the tree(s). Nice.</td>', 'I love windows, but there are so many other shapes here as well, caused by the discolorations in the wall and the negative space in the tree(s). Nice.', '2006-01-10 09:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021497, 276366, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the way the objects fade into black. I think it could have been cropped closer, though. You need some action at the edges, I think.</td>', 'I like the way the objects fade into black. I think it could have been cropped closer, though. You need some action at the edges, I think.', '2006-01-10 09:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021499, 276394, 50695, '<td valign="top">ah, the glorious shapes of flora! if only you had some background...</td>', 'ah, the glorious shapes of flora! if only you had some background...', '2006-01-10 09:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021500, 274204, 50695, '<td valign="top">that looks delicious.</td>', 'that looks delicious.', '2006-01-10 09:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021502, 273438, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the fuzzy red flame coming out of your silver rocket.</td>', 'I like the fuzzy red flame coming out of your silver rocket.', '2006-01-10 09:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021505, 275845, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how you make the pole look like a triangle.</td>', 'I like how you make the pole look like a triangle.', '2006-01-10 09:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021507, 275633, 50695, '<td valign="top">I only count 8. But that''s infinity sideways, right?</td>', 'I only count 8. But that''s infinity sideways, right?', '2006-01-10 09:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021508, 273905, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how this looks like a conch shell!</td>', 'I like how this looks like a conch shell!', '2006-01-10 09:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021521, 273915, 24546, '<td valign="top">Great idea - needs a little more contrast.</td>', 'Great idea - needs a little more contrast.', '2006-01-10 09:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021535, 276013, 24546, '<td valign="top">Your point of interest here is the drinker - I think this is a great photo - and it does have shapes, but I don''t think that shapes are the first thing I think of when I view this shot.</td>', 'Your point of interest here is the drinker - I think this is a great photo - and it does have shapes, but I don''t think that shapes are the first thing I think of when I view this shot.', '2006-01-10 09:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021541, 276454, 11793, '<td valign="top">top 20 i bet.  good luck</td>', 'top 20 i bet.  good luck', '2006-01-10 09:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021550, 275622, 24546, '<td valign="top">Great idea - I think it would have been a stronger photo with a deeper depth of field such that the everything was sharp.</td>', 'Great idea - I think it would have been a stronger photo with a deeper depth of field such that the everything was sharp.', '2006-01-10 09:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021572, 275617, 24546, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough</td>', 'Not sharp enough', '2006-01-10 09:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021596, 273937, 24546, '<td valign="top">While  I like your use of color here and shape is definitely a theme here - nothing in this photo is sharp.</td>', 'While  I like your use of color here and shape is definitely a theme here - nothing in this photo is sharp.', '2006-01-10 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021608, 274151, 24546, '<td valign="top">Good idea - just not sharp enough</td>', 'Good idea - just not sharp enough', '2006-01-10 10:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021609, 275290, 24546, '<td valign="top">Good idea - just not sharp enough</td>', 'Good idea - just not sharp enough', '2006-01-10 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021614, 276421, 45478, '<td valign="top">Great shot - I love the detail on the showflake.</td>', 'Great shot - I love the detail on the showflake.', '2006-01-10 10:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021628, 276003, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait -but I''m drawn to her face rather than to the shapes.</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait -but I''m drawn to her face rather than to the shapes.', '2006-01-10 10:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021629, 276284, 24546, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but not enough contrast - the egg gets lost in the background - and the shadows are not quite strong enough</td>', 'Good idea, but not enough contrast - the egg gets lost in the background - and the shadows are not quite strong enough', '2006-01-10 10:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021646, 274084, 24546, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough</td>', 'Not sharp enough', '2006-01-10 10:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021648, 275312, 24546, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough</td>', 'Not sharp enough', '2006-01-10 10:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021653, 274057, 24546, '<td valign="top">Nice study of color, but I don''t find myself thinking shape as the primary theme here.  While it is unfocused - it is pleasing to the eye due to its abstract and artistic nature.</td>', 'Nice study of color, but I don''t find myself thinking shape as the primary theme here.  While it is unfocused - it is pleasing to the eye due to its abstract and artistic nature.', '2006-01-10 10:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021655, 273733, 40973, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-17 12:13:01.</i></td>', '.', '2006-01-10 10:38:05.000000', '2006-08-17 13:13:01.000000', 1),
(2021659, 276187, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like how you had quite a different take on shapes by presenting shapes made by shadow. My critique on this piece is that I think you could have easily cropped off more negative space on the right. It does little to help with the composition overall and closely cropping it will help maintain the viewers focus on the main subject - the hands and the shadow on the wall. Also I would have liked to have seen the hands in sharper focus - the fingers on the hand in the forefront are slightly blurred. Another element that could help in improving this composition is the close down the aperature (if possible) to increase the depth of field such that the shadow is also in sharper focus.</td>', 'I like how you had quite a different take on shapes by presenting shapes made by shadow. My critique on this piece is that I think you could have easily cropped off more negative space on the right. It does little to help with the composition overall and closely cropping it will help maintain the viewers focus on the main subject - the hands and the shadow on the wall. Also I would have liked to have seen the hands in sharper focus - the fingers on the hand in the forefront are slightly blurred. Another element that could help in improving this composition is the close down the aperature (if possible) to increase the depth of field such that the shadow is also in sharper focus.', '2006-01-10 10:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021668, 276456, 24546, '<td valign="top">I''ve been here this time of year - this shot is more effective when the tree is not centered and your camera angle shows both the tree and the sea stacks without competing.  Here is a similar shot that I have taken here:<br/>//www.io.com/~hmelton/maryann/index.cgi?I20040910190357.JPG</td>', 'I''ve been here this time of year - this shot is more effective when the tree is not centered and your camera angle shows both the tree and the sea stacks without competing.  Here is a similar shot that I have taken here://www.io.com/~hmelton/maryann/index.cgi?I20040910190357.JPG', '2006-01-10 10:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021674, 275459, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait -but I''m drawn to her face rather than to the shapes.</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait -but I''m drawn to her face rather than to the shapes.', '2006-01-10 10:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021676, 273738, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait -but I''m drawn to her face rather than to the shapes.</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait -but I''m drawn to her face rather than to the shapes.', '2006-01-10 10:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021682, 274099, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like how you play with perspective here by presenting the triangular shaped chocolate in a straight line that our eye has to follow till we reach the end in the background. This helps to keep a viewer''s attention. Now I do have some critiques on the composition for there are some elements that could improve. First, the white background comes off as too stark and sterile to bring out the rich tones and colors of the chocolate. It color of the chocolate looks a little too washed out. Black (or a dark hue) maybe the better choice to bring out richer colors  in the chocolate to entice our eyes to want to take a bite as well. Even the introduction of a background that has visible texture that is complementary to the imagery you want to convey could be a nice addition- i.e. a velvet cloth conjures the ideas of "soft" and "smooth" in the viewers. Those ideas helps establish a connection with the main image -the chocolate. The viewer then makes the connection of "tasting" the chocolate as smooth and soft.</td>', 'I like how you play with perspective here by presenting the triangular shaped chocolate in a straight line that our eye has to follow till we reach the end in the background. This helps to keep a viewer''s attention. Now I do have some critiques on the composition for there are some elements that could improve. First, the white background comes off as too stark and sterile to bring out the rich tones and colors of the chocolate. It color of the chocolate looks a little too washed out. Black (or a dark hue) maybe the better choice to bring out richer colors  in the chocolate to entice our eyes to want to take a bite as well. Even the introduction of a background that has visible texture that is complementary to the imagery you want to convey could be a nice addition- i.e. a velvet cloth conjures the ideas of "soft" and "smooth" in the viewers. Those ideas helps establish a connection with the main image -the chocolate. The viewer then makes the connection of "tasting" the chocolate as smooth and soft.', '2006-01-10 10:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021697, 273680, 24546, '<td valign="top">While shape is definitely a component in this shot (the wooden blocks) - the child''s face at the top draws my eye away from the shapes - because it is a face and because that is the brightest part of the photo</td>', 'While shape is definitely a component in this shot (the wooden blocks) - the child''s face at the top draws my eye away from the shapes - because it is a face and because that is the brightest part of the photo', '2006-01-10 10:57:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2021700, 275206, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is a strong dramatic photo - well lit but shape is not my first thought when I look at it.</td>', 'This is a strong dramatic photo - well lit but shape is not my first thought when I look at it.', '2006-01-10 10:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021701, 275973, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the curves and shapes seen in this composition. The curves of the bridge allow the eye to pleasently coast over this bridge as we explore the photo. Our eye also travels up to the top most portions of the bridge. There we see the Retangular support struct/''towers'' that contain black outlined diamond shapes amounst the backdrop of the night sky. Tones and hues are lovely and appealing. Great capture.</td>', 'Love the curves and shapes seen in this composition. The curves of the bridge allow the eye to pleasently coast over this bridge as we explore the photo. Our eye also travels up to the top most portions of the bridge. There we see the Retangular support struct/''towers'' that contain black outlined diamond shapes amounst the backdrop of the night sky. Tones and hues are lovely and appealing. Great capture.', '2006-01-10 11:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021706, 274118, 43463, '<td valign="top">Black and white tones are spot on and not washed out. Strong dominent shapes are prominent throughout the composition.</td>', 'Black and white tones are spot on and not washed out. Strong dominent shapes are prominent throughout the composition.', '2006-01-10 11:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021707, 276471, 48595, '<td valign="top">A little dark but still a good photo though.</td>', 'A little dark but still a good photo though.', '2006-01-10 11:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021742, 274900, 11793, '<td valign="top">nice work - good luck</td>', 'nice work - good luck', '2006-01-10 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021744, 275619, 11793, '<td valign="top">nice abstract - good color - good luck !</td>', 'nice abstract - good color - good luck !', '2006-01-10 11:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021773, 276022, 33947, '<td valign="top">Excellent, excellent, excellent!!! Great line and composition, and exquisite lighting on the lamp. Plus, I love the shape of the lamp (and one of these days I''m going to get one!!). Like the change of backround, and all colors work nicely together. Good job!Wonderful luminosity. 10</td>', 'Excellent, excellent, excellent!!! Great line and composition, and exquisite lighting on the lamp. Plus, I love the shape of the lamp (and one of these days I''m going to get one!!). Like the change of backround, and all colors work nicely together. Good job!Wonderful luminosity. 10', '2006-01-10 11:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021790, 275901, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting. Very fun shape, and great contrast. Love it. Second pass -would bump if I could but already gave a 10. Gorgeous luminosity.</td>', 'Fabulous lighting. Very fun shape, and great contrast. Love it. Second pass -would bump if I could but already gave a 10. Gorgeous luminosity.', '2006-01-10 11:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021804, 276037, 50642, '<td valign="top">Good job!</td>', 'Good job!', '2006-01-10 11:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021810, 276226, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the curve and line of this image. The position and capture itself is very well done. Nice light and highlights.</td>', 'Love the curve and line of this image. The position and capture itself is very well done. Nice light and highlights.', '2006-01-10 11:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021819, 276203, 48717, '<td valign="top">Very nice color, it is a bit blurry, so perhaps you should have used a tripod, or some sort of stable surface to placec the camera on.</td>', 'Very nice color, it is a bit blurry, so perhaps you should have used a tripod, or some sort of stable surface to placec the camera on.', '2006-01-10 12:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021825, 274677, 48717, '<td valign="top">This pic could benefit from a longer exposure and a tripod, it is a little dark and a little blurry.</td>', 'This pic could benefit from a longer exposure and a tripod, it is a little dark and a little blurry.', '2006-01-10 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021828, 276311, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, good color and contrast.</td>', 'Nice angle, good color and contrast.', '2006-01-10 12:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021832, 274904, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice soft colors, but your depth of field if off, the subject is not in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice soft colors, but your depth of field if off, the subject is not in sharp focus.', '2006-01-10 12:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021834, 276169, 48717, '<td valign="top">Very nice, exposure, contrast and color well done.</td>', 'Very nice, exposure, contrast and color well done.', '2006-01-10 12:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021839, 275927, 48717, '<td valign="top">Your composition is good, but your colors are flat, the color balance may off a bit or maybe your contrast.</td>', 'Your composition is good, but your colors are flat, the color balance may off a bit or maybe your contrast.', '2006-01-10 12:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021842, 276061, 50016, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how I feel about the blue tint.  Might have been better if there weren''t some blue background in the top right.</td>', 'Don''t know how I feel about the blue tint.  Might have been better if there weren''t some blue background in the top right.', '2006-01-10 12:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021843, 274146, 50016, '<td valign="top">Feels a little too dark</td>', 'Feels a little too dark', '2006-01-10 12:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021844, 273341, 50016, '<td valign="top">Like the background, just don''t find the image that interesting.</td>', 'Like the background, just don''t find the image that interesting.', '2006-01-10 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021846, 275210, 50016, '<td valign="top">Too pink</td>', 'Too pink', '2006-01-10 12:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021849, 274162, 50016, '<td valign="top">Great detail.</td>', 'Great detail.', '2006-01-10 12:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021850, 275527, 48717, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed and has a lot of potential.  The image is flat, you need to adjust the white levels, contrast and the color balance.  Give it a try and you will see the difference.</td>', 'This is nicely composed and has a lot of potential.  The image is flat, you need to adjust the white levels, contrast and the color balance.  Give it a try and you will see the difference.', '2006-01-10 12:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021851, 276392, 50016, '<td valign="top">Great image, just don''t get the title.  I hope it is not implying that we should be jealous of your skills.  That would be presumptuous.</td>', 'Great image, just don''t get the title.  I hope it is not implying that we should be jealous of your skills.  That would be presumptuous.', '2006-01-10 12:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021852, 276443, 50016, '<td valign="top">Feels a little out of focus.  Great background color.</td>', 'Feels a little out of focus.  Great background color.', '2006-01-10 12:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021855, 275923, 50016, '<td valign="top">Good stuff.</td>', 'Good stuff.', '2006-01-10 12:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021857, 273810, 50016, '<td valign="top">Like the angle, just wish everything were in focus.</td>', 'Like the angle, just wish everything were in focus.', '2006-01-10 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021861, 275474, 50016, '<td valign="top">Wish there were more contrast between the object and the background.</td>', 'Wish there were more contrast between the object and the background.', '2006-01-10 12:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2021862, 276429, 50016, '<td valign="top">Wish there were nothing distracting down the hallway.</td>', 'Wish there were nothing distracting down the hallway.', '2006-01-10 12:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
