(2023248, 275687, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this.  Toning works well.  Reflection seems good.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a fraction sharper may have helped this in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Like this.  Toning works well.  Reflection seems good.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a fraction sharper may have helped this in my opinion.', '2006-01-10 21:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
