(2023331, 276169, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this and your title.  Criticism; difficult, but maybe cropping out the ''people'' may have made this better in my opinion, not sure.  Might just be the perspective/angle, but given the overall ''symmetry'' and balance, looks like this needs a fraction nudge rotate up on the left, just seems ''slightly'' off, but fairly minor.</td>', '7 - Like this and your title.  Criticism; difficult, but maybe cropping out the ''people'' may have made this better in my opinion, not sure.  Might just be the perspective/angle, but given the overall ''symmetry'' and balance, looks like this needs a fraction nudge rotate up on the left, just seems ''slightly'' off, but fairly minor.', '2006-01-10 21:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023335, 275252, 35545, '<td valign="top">This is a great pattern picture, but unfortunately, to my eye, there is so much pattern that you can''t see the shape of the zebras.</td>', 'This is a great pattern picture, but unfortunately, to my eye, there is so much pattern that you can''t see the shape of the zebras.', '2006-01-10 21:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023340, 275194, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this.  Criticism; mainly which it were a little sharper to show more texture, but you may have lost that good DOF so not sure. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-11 00:48:09.</i></td>', '7 - Like this.  Criticism; mainly which it were a little sharper to show more texture, but you may have lost that good DOF so not sure. edit:typo', '2006-01-10 21:28:11.000000', '2006-01-11 00:48:09.000000', 1),
(2023341, 273831, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the cloud shape and light capture.  Criticism; seems a bit of oversharpening on the edges, which for basic editing, was likely difficult to control.  Contrast seems fairly good in the cloud itself but some minor issues in the sky, but again, difficult to control/adjust in basic.</td>', '6 - Like the cloud shape and light capture.  Criticism; seems a bit of oversharpening on the edges, which for basic editing, was likely difficult to control.  Contrast seems fairly good in the cloud itself but some minor issues in the sky, but again, difficult to control/adjust in basic.', '2006-01-10 21:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023352, 276400, 43442, '<td valign="top">You could have made this shot from the top of the Vase down.  Well Done</td>', 'You could have made this shot from the top of the Vase down.  Well Done', '2006-01-10 21:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023361, 276436, 37334, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view amd nice leading line.</td>', 'Interesting point of view amd nice leading line.', '2006-01-10 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023362, 274789, 35545, '<td valign="top">You certainly have some good shapes to work with here, and I like it that you used b&amp;w.  However, I think you need more contrast.  The shapes really don''t stand out from the background.</td>', 'You certainly have some good shapes to work with here, and I like it that you used b&w.  However, I think you need more contrast.  The shapes really don''t stand out from the background.', '2006-01-10 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023368, 275217, 43442, '<td valign="top">The bright out of focus object(  bottom left )takes ones eyes away from th subject.</td>', 'The bright out of focus object(  bottom left )takes ones eyes away from th subject.', '2006-01-10 21:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023369, 275216, 35545, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is too shallow.  I can''t figure out what I''m looking at.  Great colors though.</td>', 'Depth of field is too shallow.  I can''t figure out what I''m looking at.  Great colors though.', '2006-01-10 21:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
