(2023405, 273696, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - This is a shot of ''another shot'' primarily in my opinion and the ''squares'', while do add to this, are not the main subject.</td>', '2 - This is a shot of ''another shot'' primarily in my opinion and the ''squares'', while do add to this, are not the main subject.', '2006-01-10 21:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
