(2024108, 276477, 18367, '<td valign="top">Funny thing that..... I had this pegged as one of yours when I first saw it, mentioned it to a friend and after a careful study of the image, we both agreed that there was NO WAY this was yours, since there were things in the image that we know full well you would normally have taken care  of.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your placement Dan, and thanks for throwing me off... hehehehe.  The image is indeed quite good, it''s just that ... well you know.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'Funny thing that..... I had this pegged as one of yours when I first saw it, mentioned it to a friend and after a careful study of the image, we both agreed that there was NO WAY this was yours, since there were things in the image that we know full well you would normally have taken care  of. Congrats on your placement Dan, and thanks for throwing me off... hehehehe.  The image is indeed quite good, it''s just that ... well you know. Ray', '2006-01-11 00:34:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024109, 276477, 6519, '<td valign="top">As soon as I saw this photo, my very first thought was: "that one is grapicfunk''s". <br/>Then i looked at it closer. Still thought that the hand and that wonderful POV looks soooooooo much like it must be his, but Daniel would NEVER submit something like that. There are two MAJOR flaws in this photo, so it couldn''t possibly be his.<br/> <br/>Couldn''t help but smile when I read your words, Daniel. <br/>I can feel your pain, and yet you still made it to 14th place!!!!!<br/>Not bad at all to get 6.5 for something you''re not happy about, huh?<br/></td>', 'As soon as I saw this photo, my very first thought was: "that one is grapicfunk''s". Then i looked at it closer. Still thought that the hand and that wonderful POV looks soooooooo much like it must be his, but Daniel would NEVER submit something like that. There are two MAJOR flaws in this photo, so it couldn''t possibly be his. Couldn''t help but smile when I read your words, Daniel. I can feel your pain, and yet you still made it to 14th place!!!!!Not bad at all to get 6.5 for something you''re not happy about, huh?', '2006-01-11 00:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024111, 275845, 42013, '<td valign="top">I voted 4, should have left a comment so I will now.  The Good: liked the BW, think it works good here. Liked the DOF, seems pretty deep.<br/> <br/>The Bad IMO: 1) Pole is centered which seems more static to me.  Possibly an offcenter crop with pole angleing through the frame would have complemented the other angles.  2) Just too much going on in the frame so hard for my eye to find a focus and it tends to just move on.<br/> <br/>my 2cents.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting.</td>', 'I voted 4, should have left a comment so I will now.  The Good: liked the BW, think it works good here. Liked the DOF, seems pretty deep. The Bad IMO: 1) Pole is centered which seems more static to me.  Possibly an offcenter crop with pole angleing through the frame would have complemented the other angles.  2) Just too much going on in the frame so hard for my eye to find a focus and it tends to just move on. my 2cents. Keep shooting.', '2006-01-11 00:34:51.000000', NULL, 0),
