(2024262, 273731, 48928, '<td valign="top">For any of those who had asked, what I did for the picture was drop red food coloring into a vase.  Anybody see the dog in the middle?  lol.  Anyways flipping the photo I think had a big impact on the photo...<br/>Biggest mistakes was not cropping a little bit from the left hand side, and one thing I couldn''t fix was the darkness on the right side of the "out of the ordinary" shape.  OH well...  <br/> <br/>Sidenote:  Could not disagree more with the first place ribbon, there were SOOO many better photos in there!</td>', 'For any of those who had asked, what I did for the picture was drop red food coloring into a vase.  Anybody see the dog in the middle?  lol.  Anyways flipping the photo I think had a big impact on the photo...Biggest mistakes was not cropping a little bit from the left hand side, and one thing I couldn''t fix was the darkness on the right side of the "out of the ordinary" shape.  OH well...   Sidenote:  Could not disagree more with the first place ribbon, there were SOOO many better photos in there!', '2006-01-11 01:01:15.000000', NULL, 0),
