(2026399, 275927, 46885, '<td valign="top">I take the point on lighting - my laptop gave a nice amber hue, but it''s only two days ago I realised the WB in camera was set to shade. I would beg to differ on lighting - I like the softness of it and a little transitory vertical stripe. This, actually, what reminded me of a tree.</td>', 'I take the point on lighting - my laptop gave a nice amber hue, but it''s only two days ago I realised the WB in camera was set to shade. I would beg to differ on lighting - I like the softness of it and a little transitory vertical stripe. This, actually, what reminded me of a tree.', '2006-01-11 12:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
