(2026446, 275208, 46885, '<td valign="top">I know this will sound cliched - but what is the beauty of this shot? Someone did a great metalwork, someone just pointed a tele at it and was good enough not to screw up metering under comfy uniform lighting whilst not being good enough to give sharp edges. A correct representation of good metal work, that''s it. Does it merit 5+?</td>', 'I know this will sound cliched - but what is the beauty of this shot? Someone did a great metalwork, someone just pointed a tele at it and was good enough not to screw up metering under comfy uniform lighting whilst not being good enough to give sharp edges. A correct representation of good metal work, that''s it. Does it merit 5+?', '2006-01-11 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 0),
