(2026879, 275527, 41999, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for your votes, your kind comments, and your suggestions.<br/> <br/>Under basic rules this image was a tough one: tweak the car and lose the sky; enhance the sky and loose the car. I have reworked the image under advanced rules here: <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=279721" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41999/thumb/279721.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41999/thumb/279721.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41999/thumb/279721.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>edit to add thumbnail<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-10 23:02:19.</i></td>', 'Thank you very much for your votes, your kind comments, and your suggestions. Under basic rules this image was a tough one: tweak the car and lose the sky; enhance the sky and loose the car. I have reworked the image under advanced rules here:    edit to add thumbnail', '2006-01-11 14:34:56.000000', '2006-08-11 00:02:19.000000', 0),
