(2027140, 276033, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice ambience!  I bookmarked this in my favorites because I want to reference your style for the future since I really like the warmth!<br/> <br/>Awww. Don''t tell me he''s fake!  <br/>In my mind he was a poor little tree frog who went "out on a limb" to invite the one girl who really "makes his palms sweat" on a date to this club where the music''s always "hoppin''."<br/>After being brutally rebuffed, he slinked away to "drown his tears in a wine glass" and <b>"frog-get."</b>  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-11 16:00:37.</i></td>', 'Nice ambience!  I bookmarked this in my favorites because I want to reference your style for the future since I really like the warmth! Awww. Don''t tell me he''s fake!  In my mind he was a poor little tree frog who went "out on a limb" to invite the one girl who really "makes his palms sweat" on a date to this club where the music''s always "hoppin''."After being brutally rebuffed, he slinked away to "drown his tears in a wine glass" and "frog-get."  :)', '2006-01-11 15:59:13.000000', '2006-01-11 16:00:37.000000', 0),
