(2027625, 275023, 41746, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one is sooo....underrated. Thought it would at least be in the top 20. One of my favorites. I don´t mind not knowing excatly what the photo is showing, river and frosty flowers I guess, because it´s pure beauty of form and colors are more than enough. Excellent composition overlooked by far too many.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-11 18:30:49.</i></td>', 'Wow, this one is sooo....underrated. Thought it would at least be in the top 20. One of my favorites. I don´t mind not knowing excatly what the photo is showing, river and frosty flowers I guess, because it´s pure beauty of form and colors are more than enough. Excellent composition overlooked by far too many.', '2006-01-11 18:30:13.000000', '2006-01-11 18:30:49.000000', 0),
(2027649, 274199, 47020, '<td valign="top">wow a DSLR that does multiple exposures... very nice (and a very nice use of that feature, as evidenced by your ribbon).  I wish Canon would add that feature... I''ve been missing it.</td>', 'wow a DSLR that does multiple exposures... very nice (and a very nice use of that feature, as evidenced by your ribbon).  I wish Canon would add that feature... I''ve been missing it.', '2006-01-11 18:36:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2027654, 276470, 29404, '<td valign="top">that is amazingly beautiful</td>', 'that is amazingly beautiful', '2006-01-11 18:39:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2027662, 275233, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 4.  The main shape to me was the circle, the bell in the middle was of course another shape but not as ''classic'' as the circle, and not what I would deem a ''classic bell shape'' (if that makes sense).  I think if you had incorporated more space around the circle (depending what you had to work with of course), this at 640 (height in this case) and sharper (looks more like ''blur''/shake issues rather than focus, but not sure), would all have made this better in my opinion.  Also, minor, but your title draws attention (for those that read it) to the bell, which, although minor, detracts from the ''strongest shape'' in this shot.</td>', 'I gave this a 4.  The main shape to me was the circle, the bell in the middle was of course another shape but not as ''classic'' as the circle, and not what I would deem a ''classic bell shape'' (if that makes sense).  I think if you had incorporated more space around the circle (depending what you had to work with of course), this at 640 (height in this case) and sharper (looks more like ''blur''/shake issues rather than focus, but not sure), would all have made this better in my opinion.  Also, minor, but your title draws attention (for those that read it) to the bell, which, although minor, detracts from the ''strongest shape'' in this shot.', '2006-01-11 18:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2027665, 276470, 42567, '<td valign="top">WOW...very nice.!!</td>', 'WOW...very nice.!!', '2006-01-11 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2027809, 275312, 11793, '<td valign="top">congrats - nice work.</td>', 'congrats - nice work.', '2006-01-11 19:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2027849, 276470, 24642, '<td valign="top">Congrats Neil, this is brilliant.</td>', 'Congrats Neil, this is brilliant.', '2006-01-11 19:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
