(2028535, 276454, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. I like the pose, the slight lighting of the subject and there is something very spicy about the edges where the garment has altered the smooth lines of contour.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice pic. I like the pose, the slight lighting of the subject and there is something very spicy about the edges where the garment has altered the smooth lines of contour. ', '2006-01-11 23:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2028541, 276456, 37779, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you back where you belong, sir. It''s cool to see that in photos since I''ve seen it in real life too. Very awesome.</td>', 'Nice to see you back where you belong, sir. It''s cool to see that in photos since I''ve seen it in real life too. Very awesome.', '2006-01-11 23:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2028563, 275368, 28710, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is great!<br/> <br/>I noticed that your background colour isn''t a true black.<br/> <br/>I think it looks very nice like that. Adds a bit of softness rather than a harsh background.<br/> <br/>I am going to guess that this was done intentionally.<br/> <br/>I''m a big fan of the triptych form.</td>', 'Wow. This is great! I noticed that your background colour isn''t a true black. I think it looks very nice like that. Adds a bit of softness rather than a harsh background. I am going to guess that this was done intentionally. I''m a big fan of the triptych form.', '2006-01-11 23:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
