(2029568, 274841, 48471, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t it be better if you didn''t lean forward towards the chair? As it is, the pose looks a bit strange, because I don''t see the 3D effect (the curves of the buttock) that leaning is supposed to achieve. A strait S curve would have been better, I guess.<br/>Anyway, a very nice photo...the one at the mother challenge as well...</td>', 'Wouldn''t it be better if you didn''t lean forward towards the chair? As it is, the pose looks a bit strange, because I don''t see the 3D effect (the curves of the buttock) that leaning is supposed to achieve. A strait S curve would have been better, I guess.Anyway, a very nice photo...the one at the mother challenge as well...', '2006-01-12 10:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
