(2030571, 276186, 35208, '<td valign="top">Well that was fun!  Thanks to everyone for the encouraging comments and votes.  The effect was created using a data projector and a PowerPoint slide of a white grid.</td>', 'Well that was fun!  Thanks to everyone for the encouraging comments and votes.  The effect was created using a data projector and a PowerPoint slide of a white grid.', '2006-01-12 15:54:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2030852, 273674, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yup. That''s a shape. ;)<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? It''s a departure from your last three entries. This one has clothes!<br/>- Good focus? No. it''s a bit out-of-focus, especially near the top and at the seam onear the pocket.<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? It''s a little over lit, but that may have to do with the changing in background color. Give me some more shadows to show the textures more.<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- Colors and Contrast. Maybe try this as a B&amp;W form or desaturate everything, but the blues only half way?<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? I''m trying to reconcile the title to the picture. A little sarcasm? As for the image I am left wanting more.<br/></td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yup. That''s a shape. ;) Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? It''s a departure from your last three entries. This one has clothes!- Good focus? No. it''s a bit out-of-focus, especially near the top and at the seam onear the pocket. Lighting - Good use of light? It''s a little over lit, but that may have to do with the changing in background color. Give me some more shadows to show the textures more. Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- Colors and Contrast. Maybe try this as a B&W form or desaturate everything, but the blues only half way?- What is my reaction or feelings? I''m trying to reconcile the title to the picture. A little sarcasm? As for the image I am left wanting more.', '2006-01-12 17:37:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2030910, 273896, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed?  I really didn''t know what to think here. I feel like I am missing out on the bigger picture, however the image you captured. is good. Nice textures.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes. I like the softness to the front of the image.<br/>- Good focus? Yes<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes. I love the reflections and the shadows.<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? It''s a nice shape, but you had very heavy competition for this one.</td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed?  I really didn''t know what to think here. I feel like I am missing out on the bigger picture, however the image you captured. is good. Nice textures.- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes. I like the softness to the front of the image.- Good focus? Yes Lighting - Good use of light? Yes. I love the reflections and the shadows. Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings? It''s a nice shape, but you had very heavy competition for this one.', '2006-01-12 17:54:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2030956, 276477, 19672, '<td valign="top">Okay Graphicfunk, I''m really surprised at you?  You are not the type to usually leave such a distracting element as is seen in the bottom left corner. <br/> <br/>I thought this was a really nice shot but had to take a point or so off because of that corner. Gave you a (6) bro but would have been an easy (7+).<br/> <br/>It just seemed like something that COULD be avoided and should have. Alas....it''s life. Nice job still...</td>', 'Okay Graphicfunk, I''m really surprised at you?  You are not the type to usually leave such a distracting element as is seen in the bottom left corner.  I thought this was a really nice shot but had to take a point or so off because of that corner. Gave you a (6) bro but would have been an easy (7+). It just seemed like something that COULD be avoided and should have. Alas....it''s life. Nice job still...', '2006-01-12 18:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2030974, 273674, 40718, '<td valign="top">You know, I''m not sure why I gave this a 5.  I guess perhaps I was biased to more geometric designs.  The picture, on second look, is pretty good.  I''m really surprised by the 4.8.  Maybe voters had the same bias.<br/> <br/>The colors are very pleasing.  The exposure is good and the picture is sharp except for the jean jacket which looks a bit soft.  I''m not sure why only there, but it does.  Maybe the lens.  I dunno.<br/> <br/>If I could vote over, I''d do a 6 for sure and maybe even a 7.  The strongest aspect to this picture is the excellent complementary colors.  The biggest problem, for your photography, is that she has her pants on.</td>', 'You know, I''m not sure why I gave this a 5.  I guess perhaps I was biased to more geometric designs.  The picture, on second look, is pretty good.  I''m really surprised by the 4.8.  Maybe voters had the same bias. The colors are very pleasing.  The exposure is good and the picture is sharp except for the jean jacket which looks a bit soft.  I''m not sure why only there, but it does.  Maybe the lens.  I dunno. If I could vote over, I''d do a 6 for sure and maybe even a 7.  The strongest aspect to this picture is the excellent complementary colors.  The biggest problem, for your photography, is that she has her pants on.', '2006-01-12 18:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2030983, 273896, 46586, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture and it''s too bad it didn''t score higher.<br/>I gave it a 8 because it was a pure shape. My only regrets were to have the curves of the shape touching the border and the white ray on the left border.<br/>Once again very nice picture ;)</td>', 'I really love this picture and it''s too bad it didn''t score higher.I gave it a 8 because it was a pure shape. My only regrets were to have the curves of the shape touching the border and the white ray on the left border.Once again very nice picture ;)', '2006-01-12 18:21:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2030997, 273896, 40718, '<td valign="top">I wind up giving this advice at least a few times each time I do threads like this.  The colors here are so muted that I would instantly think about B&amp;W.  You could make some excellent contrast here and then the picture becomes all about shape instead of us staring and wondering exactly what color the swirl is.<br/> <br/>You may have confused people a bit with the title.  I didn''t know what a Koru was, and I''m sure a lot of others didn''t either.  The picture is cropped a bit too close to give us any context.  So either you could have zoomed out, so we can get a clue as to what a Koru is, or (if you wanted to keep the picture all about "shape") kept the crop, but leave the name out of the title.  Although it seems unfair, titles can play a role in your score.  Not a huge part, but maybe a tenth or two.</td>', 'I wind up giving this advice at least a few times each time I do threads like this.  The colors here are so muted that I would instantly think about B&W.  You could make some excellent contrast here and then the picture becomes all about shape instead of us staring and wondering exactly what color the swirl is. You may have confused people a bit with the title.  I didn''t know what a Koru was, and I''m sure a lot of others didn''t either.  The picture is cropped a bit too close to give us any context.  So either you could have zoomed out, so we can get a clue as to what a Koru is, or (if you wanted to keep the picture all about "shape") kept the crop, but leave the name out of the title.  Although it seems unfair, titles can play a role in your score.  Not a huge part, but maybe a tenth or two.', '2006-01-12 18:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2031011, 276454, 19672, '<td valign="top">Oh cool...<br/> <br/>I didn''t know that was you, but you got a (9).<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>I should have known it was the self-portrait queen.</td>', 'Oh cool... I didn''t know that was you, but you got a (9). :) I should have known it was the self-portrait queen.', '2006-01-12 18:27:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2031047, 273674, 46448, '<td valign="top">I like this one, its prefect for the challenge. The colors are great! A little bit of purple/pink behind the leg kinda confuses me a bit. I think this should have placed much higher.</td>', 'I like this one, its prefect for the challenge. The colors are great! A little bit of purple/pink behind the leg kinda confuses me a bit. I think this should have placed much higher.', '2006-01-12 18:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2031078, 273748, 5885, '<td valign="top"><b>First Impression - the most important one:</b> <br/>I rated your image an 8. It was fun and creative and I was very curious how you captured the spark.<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Composition is intersting. Perhaps moving the spark-plug to the left a little and putting it into the top right third of the image would have made it a bit stronger.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>While I found the subject fun and creative. I know what a spark-plug is and how fst they spark. Probably not a lot of voters got that.<br/> <br/><b>Technical (Colour, focus, and light):</b> <br/>Colour is one of your strongest features of the image. Lighting is good, but I''m seeing it as slightly underexposed. <br/> <br/>Focus is one of my problems with it. It is in sharp focus, but I''d like to see the DoF a little deeper and get some more of the sparkplug into focus.<br/> <br/><b>To grow its vote?:</b> <br/>Do something boringly like everyone else? That is just my opinion. But, perhaps many didn''t see this as fitting shape.<br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>While I admired your photo and gave it an 8, I think getting closer to challenge ''expectations" is the only way to get the really high scores. You should be proud of this photo.</td>', 'First Impression - the most important one: I rated your image an 8. It was fun and creative and I was very curious how you captured the spark. Composition: Composition is intersting. Perhaps moving the spark-plug to the left a little and putting it into the top right third of the image would have made it a bit stronger. Subject: While I found the subject fun and creative. I know what a spark-plug is and how fst they spark. Probably not a lot of voters got that. Technical (Colour, focus, and light): Colour is one of your strongest features of the image. Lighting is good, but I''m seeing it as slightly underexposed.  Focus is one of my problems with it. It is in sharp focus, but I''d like to see the DoF a little deeper and get some more of the sparkplug into focus. To grow its vote?: Do something boringly like everyone else? That is just my opinion. But, perhaps many didn''t see this as fitting shape. Summary: While I admired your photo and gave it an 8, I think getting closer to challenge ''expectations" is the only way to get the really high scores. You should be proud of this photo.', '2006-01-12 18:51:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2031115, 276132, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed?  It''s very pleasing to the eye.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes<br/>- Good focus? Yes<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes<br/>- Good use of shadows? Yes<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- Colors and Contrast. Very vibrant colors<br/>- Sharpness. The edge of the mrble has a very clean sharp edge to it. While the reflection and the board have a softness to them.<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? Jesus. For the life of my I can''t remember voting this one. I have no idea why I only gave it a 6, but I should have given it a 8. There was a LOT of heavy competition in that challenge though.<br/></td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed?  It''s very pleasing to the eye.- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes- Good focus? Yes Lighting - Good use of light? Yes- Good use of shadows? Yes Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- Colors and Contrast. Very vibrant colors- Sharpness. The edge of the mrble has a very clean sharp edge to it. While the reflection and the board have a softness to them.- What is my reaction or feelings? Jesus. For the life of my I can''t remember voting this one. I have no idea why I only gave it a 6, but I should have given it a 8. There was a LOT of heavy competition in that challenge though.', '2006-01-12 19:04:14.000000', NULL, 0),
