(2031523, 276208, 46448, '<td valign="top">Marc, you have something here, something AWESOME...<br/>Bump up the red 50% and turn it grayscale. Man It really looks nice.</td>', 'Marc, you have something here, something AWESOME...Bump up the red 50% and turn it grayscale. Man It really looks nice.', '2006-01-12 22:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
